00:06:31,320 --> 00:06:31,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wang Sheng's survival points: 4]
Confirm.</font>

175
00:06:32,960 --> 00:06:35,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can enter the Flower Room alone</font>

176
00:06:35,640 --> 00:06:38,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to view the info of one of the opposite-sex islanders,</font>

177
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:40,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or invite one of them to enter the Flower Room</font>

178
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:43,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and view yours.</font>

179
00:06:44,280 --> 00:06:45,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd like to invite...</font>

180
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:47,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wang Sheng invites Ren Chunxi]
Ren Chunxi.</font>

181
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:48,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[View love profile]
To view my love profile.</font>

182
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:02,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Welcome to the Flower Room.</font>

183
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:04,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everything here is for your eyes only.</font>

184
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:07,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since Wang Sheng has sent you a Flower Room invitation,</font>

185
00:07:07,520 --> 00:07:08,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can now check Wang Sheng's</font>

186
00:07:08,760 --> 00:07:09,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"About Love".</font>

187
00:07:09,800 --> 00:07:11,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After viewing it, you will unlock</font>

188
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:12,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">an exclusive private chat for the two of you.</font>

189
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Each box with the islanders' names contains their "Love and Bread" info.]</font>

190
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was actually quite surprised.</font>

191
00:07:16,640 --> 00:07:18,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At the time, I really thought it was</font>

192
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:20,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tobe who invited me.</font>

193
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:22,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't expect it to be Koala.</font>

194
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:40,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wang Sheng's letter about love before arriving on the island]</font>

195
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:42,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is late at night</font>

196
00:07:42,160 --> 00:07:45,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on July 27, 2026.</font>

197
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:46,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wonder how you, the one opening this letter,</font>

198
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:48,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are doing right now.</font>

199
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:49,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you enjoying your trip?</font>

200
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:54,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to open up and share my true self with you</font>

201
00:07:54,400 --> 00:07:56,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when my emotions are at their peak in the night.</font>

202
00:07:56,280 --> 00:07:58,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My understanding of love</font>

203
00:07:58,200 --> 00:08:00,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">probably has to start with my parents.</font>

204
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:04,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My family wasn't very happy when I was a kid.</font>

205
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:08,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was just constant arguments, cold wars, and</font>

206
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:10,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the silence when neither of us would speak.</font>

207
00:08:11,280 --> 00:08:12,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I came back from school,</font>

208
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if it was quiet when I opened the door,</font>

209
00:08:14,280 --> 00:08:16,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had to read their moods first</font>

210
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:19,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to know whether we could have a peaceful meal today.</font>

211
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:22,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That feeling of walking on eggshells seems to always follow me.</font>

212
00:08:22,760 --> 00:08:25,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So later on, I kept thinking,</font>

213
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if I'm ever going to live with someone in the future,</font>

214
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:29,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never want to live like that again.</font>

215
00:08:30,200 --> 00:08:33,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just feel that life is already exhausting enough.</font>

216
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:35,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why should we make our most intimate relationship</font>

217
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:36,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so hard?</font>

218
00:08:37,280 --> 00:08:38,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think in a good relationship,</font>

219
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">both of us shouldn't have to pretend.</font>

220
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:42,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need to pretend to be happy,</font>

221
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:44,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">no need to pretend to be sensible,</font>

222
00:08:44,080 --> 00:08:47,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or worry they'll shut you out if you say the wrong thing.</font>

223
00:08:48,640 --> 00:08:51,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hope I can be a very warm person.</font>

224
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:53,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not the loud, extroverted kind of warmth,</font>

225
00:08:53,520 --> 00:08:55,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but the kind of warmth that makes people feel comfortable,</font>

226
00:08:55,880 --> 00:08:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">where there's no need to force small talk.</font>

227
00:08:59,400 --> 00:09:00,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What I lacked growing up</font>

228
00:09:00,840 --> 00:09:02,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is what I want to give the most now.</font>

229
00:09:02,760 --> 00:09:04,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If one day you feel like you don't really want to talk,</font>

230
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's totally okay.</font>

231
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:07,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We don't always have to chat.</font>

232
00:09:07,560 --> 00:09:09,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just sitting next to each other is nice, too.</font>

233
00:09:09,560 --> 00:09:10,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Wang Sheng.</font>

234
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:12,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's really nice to meet you.</font>

235
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:35,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I read that letter at the time,</font>

236
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:37,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my mind was still a bit of a mess.</font>

237
00:09:37,920 --> 00:09:39,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was like getting</font>

238
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:41,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so much information all at once.</font>

239
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:43,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually, over the past few days together,</font>

240
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:47,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we haven't really gotten to know each other deeply.</font>

241
00:09:47,680 --> 00:09:50,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I felt like, suddenly,</font>

242
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:51,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a bit of the facade was stripped away.</font>

243
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:52,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's quite an intriguing feeling.</font>

244
00:10:04,160 --> 00:10:04,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hi.</font>

245
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:05,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Greets first]
Hi.</font>

246
00:10:13,520 --> 00:10:14,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I run over.</font>

247
00:10:14,680 --> 00:10:16,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where from? The dorm?</font>

248
00:10:16,720 --> 00:10:18,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, from the dining hall.</font>

249
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:19,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Averts eyes]</font>

250
00:10:19,520 --> 00:10:20,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why were you at the dining hall?</font>

251
00:10:23,200 --> 00:10:24,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was cooler there.</font>

252
00:10:24,280 --> 00:10:25,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just chatting, you know,</font>

253
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:27,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">chatting with everyone and all.</font>

254
00:10:27,640 --> 00:10:27,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

255
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:30,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Instantly gets serious]</font>

256
00:10:32,760 --> 00:10:34,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Um]</font>

257
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:35,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Fanning off the heat]</font>

258
00:10:36,560 --> 00:10:37,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm really sorry.</font>

259
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:38,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why be sorry?</font>

260
00:10:38,800 --> 00:10:40,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's nothing to apologize for.</font>

261
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:42,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I mean, I'm sorry about all the stuff I did yesterday.</font>

262
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not at all.</font>

263
00:10:42,760 --> 00:10:43,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Doing all that stuff yesterday...</font>

264
00:10:43,680 --> 00:10:44,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">taking the card to find you first,</font>

265
00:10:44,760 --> 00:10:46,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and then not inviting you.</font>

266
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:48,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, it's okay.</font>

267
00:10:48,200 --> 00:10:49,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't take it to heart.</font>

268
00:10:53,160 --> 00:10:54,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And then taking your bracelet.</font>

269
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:56,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine.</font>

270
00:10:59,520 --> 00:11:00,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And then...</font>

271
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:02,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Brain working overtime]</font>

272
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:04,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Taking the bracelet was just really...</font>

273
00:11:05,800 --> 00:11:06,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a bit too weird of me.</font>

274
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:08,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just... I didn't know what to say at the time.</font>

275
00:11:08,720 --> 00:11:09,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And...</font>

276
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:12,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just wanted to give you some positive response.</font>

277
00:11:12,560 --> 00:11:13,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know.</font>

278
00:11:13,920 --> 00:11:16,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And then I just took your stuff.</font>

279
00:11:18,160 --> 00:11:19,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought about it all night and still couldn't make sense of it.</font>

280
00:11:19,760 --> 00:11:22,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And then by the next day, I just felt...</font>

281
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:23,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not making excuses.</font>

282
00:11:23,040 --> 00:11:24,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just... I'm sorry.</font>

283
00:11:24,160 --> 00:11:25,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Sorry]
I won't do that again.</font>

284
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:26,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Sorry]
I'm sorry.</font>

285
00:11:26,400 --> 00:11:27,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't do that again.</font>

286
00:11:27,920 --> 00:11:29,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't pull that kind of stuff anymore.</font>

287
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:31,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine. Because I think...</font>

288
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:32,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the past two days have just been too intense for us.</font>

289
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:34,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Too much happened,</font>

290
00:11:34,040 --> 00:11:35,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and your head was a mess.</font>

291
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:40,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Still, none of that is an excuse to hurt someone.</font>

292
00:11:40,880 --> 00:11:41,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's okay.</font>

293
00:11:41,400 --> 00:11:43,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't think this is</font>

294
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:45,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the kind of thing where there's a right or wrong,</font>

295
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so it's not on you.</font>

296
00:11:46,840 --> 00:11:48,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've always had this flaw...</font>

297
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:52,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">which is that I want to do things perfectly.</font>

298
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:53,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But the standard of what was best</font>

299
00:11:53,800 --> 00:11:55,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was often defined by me,</font>

300
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:57,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">coming from my own subjective perspective.</font>

301
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:59,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just felt that doing something well meant it was right.</font>

302
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:00,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I thought it was good,</font>

303
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:01,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then it must be good.</font>

304
00:12:01,520 --> 00:12:03,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I completely failed to see things from</font>

305
00:12:03,040 --> 00:12:04,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">anyone else's perspective.</font>

306
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:07,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It really doesn't matter.</font>

307
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:08,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think I understand your intentions.</font>

308
00:12:08,440 --> 00:12:10,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As long as you didn't mean to make me uncomfortable</font>

309
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:11,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or awkward,</font>

310
00:12:11,520 --> 00:12:14,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that's fine.</font>

311
00:12:14,160 --> 00:12:15,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did you guys chat?</font>

312
00:12:15,680 --> 00:12:17,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You and Cai Ziyi.</font>

313
00:12:17,240 --> 00:12:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did you talk about back then?</font>

314
00:12:18,520 --> 00:12:19,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It must have been so awkward</font>

315
00:12:19,360 --> 00:12:20,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when I left.</font>

316
00:12:20,280 --> 00:12:21,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not at all, really.</font>

317
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:22,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because I feel like</font>

318
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:25,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">both she and you have</font>

319
00:12:25,920 --> 00:12:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the right to make your own choices.</font>

320
00:12:27,720 --> 00:12:29,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Plus, I think you're very sincere.</font>

321
00:12:29,800 --> 00:12:32,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right. I just felt awkward</font>

322
00:12:32,640 --> 00:12:34,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the moment.</font>

323
00:12:34,640 --> 00:12:36,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But rationally and objectively speaking,</font>

324
00:12:36,480 --> 00:12:38,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel like</font>

325
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:40,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you did nothing wrong.</font>

326
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:44,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So don't stress over it.</font>

327
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:51,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It doesn't matter anymore.</font>

328
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:52,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've read the letter, right?</font>

329
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:56,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does my handwriting look a bit like an</font>

330
00:12:56,320 --> 00:12:58,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Elementary school kid's handwriting]
elementary school kid's?</font>

331
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:59,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A bit blocky, isn't it?</font>

332
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:01,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, your handwriting is like a little kid's.</font>

333
00:13:01,280 --> 00:13:03,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think good handwriting</font>

334
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:04,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">needs to meet two criteria.</font>

335
00:13:04,320 --> 00:13:06,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First, everyone can read it.</font>

336
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:07,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And second, it has to look pretty.</font>

337
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:08,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since I can't write prettily,</font>

338
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:10,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just write a bit bigger</font>

339
00:13:10,760 --> 00:13:12,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so everyone can read it easily.</font>

340
00:13:12,280 --> 00:13:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw in your letter that you also</font>

341
00:13:14,280 --> 00:13:16,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">prefer something more relaxed</font>

342
00:13:17,920 --> 00:13:19,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and comfortable. Is that right?</font>

343
00:13:21,480 --> 00:13:22,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, exactly.</font>

344
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:25,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just hope not to disrupt</font>

345
00:13:25,520 --> 00:13:27,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">someone's normal life.</font>

346
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:29,240
