00:26:03,640 --> 00:26:04,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go where?</font>

697
00:26:04,240 --> 00:26:05,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The swings.</font>

698
00:26:05,440 --> 00:26:07,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have to make up in the exact same place.</font>

699
00:26:09,400 --> 00:26:11,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You got mad at the swings?</font>

700
00:26:11,320 --> 00:26:11,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

701
00:26:13,520 --> 00:26:14,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you get mad?</font>

702
00:26:14,880 --> 00:26:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did I say?</font>

703
00:26:16,640 --> 00:26:19,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So you didn't even realize I was mad.</font>

704
00:26:19,000 --> 00:26:20,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Huang Siyang and Liu Yuning]
I thought you were joking.</font>

705
00:26:20,120 --> 00:26:21,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really was mad.</font>

706
00:26:22,600 --> 00:26:24,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry. I didn't know.</font>

707
00:26:24,440 --> 00:26:25,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't talk like that.</font>

708
00:26:25,760 --> 00:26:26,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry,</font>

709
00:26:26,920 --> 00:26:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry.</font>

710
00:26:27,720 --> 00:26:29,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll get on my knees, okay?</font>

711
00:26:31,720 --> 00:26:32,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please forgive me.</font>

712
00:26:32,800 --> 00:26:33,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, I'm on my knees.</font>

713
00:26:35,080 --> 00:26:36,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because I never expected</font>

714
00:26:36,240 --> 00:26:37,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">her to take the 24-hour</font>

715
00:26:37,680 --> 00:26:40,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"fight" thing seriously.</font>

716
00:26:40,120 --> 00:26:42,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought it was just a joke.</font>

717
00:26:42,080 --> 00:26:43,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So when she seriously said</font>

718
00:26:43,240 --> 00:26:44,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the 24 hours were up,</font>

719
00:26:44,760 --> 00:26:47,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it was probably her giving us both a way out.</font>

720
00:26:47,640 --> 00:26:49,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I naturally</font>

721
00:26:49,360 --> 00:26:51,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">took the out.</font>

722
00:26:51,000 --> 00:26:52,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who did you vote for yesterday?</font>

723
00:26:53,560 --> 00:26:54,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yesterday, I...</font>

724
00:26:55,560 --> 00:26:56,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I voted...</font>

725
00:26:56,600 --> 00:26:57,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">voted for you.</font>

726
00:26:57,760 --> 00:26:59,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I voted for you too.</font>

727
00:26:59,480 --> 00:27:00,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who we voted for doesn't matter.</font>

728
00:27:00,800 --> 00:27:02,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What matters is the vote distribution.</font>

729
00:27:02,440 --> 00:27:04,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why were the votes distributed like that?</font>

730
00:27:04,240 --> 00:27:05,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Why were the votes distributed like that?]</font>

731
00:27:05,760 --> 00:27:06,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

732
00:27:06,480 --> 00:27:07,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On day two...</font>

733
00:27:07,720 --> 00:27:08,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Huang Siyang checked Liu Yuning's day 2 votes last night]</font>

734
00:27:08,160 --> 00:27:10,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Liu Yuning's day 2 votes]
2 Moonstones to Huang Siyang</font>

735
00:27:11,440 --> 00:27:14,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Huang Siyang: 2 | Wang Tianqing: 3]
Three Moonstones for Wang Tianqing.</font>

736
00:27:14,160 --> 00:27:15,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine. Let's just leave it at that.</font>

737
00:27:17,480 --> 00:27:19,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How do you know about Day 2's votes?</font>

738
00:27:19,240 --> 00:27:20,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course I know.</font>

739
00:27:22,800 --> 00:27:23,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You bluffed me.</font>

740
00:27:23,880 --> 00:27:25,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I actually know this.</font>

741
00:27:25,800 --> 00:27:27,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you not been to the Supply Station?</font>

742
00:27:27,480 --> 00:27:28,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why go to the Supply Station?</font>

743
00:27:28,480 --> 00:27:30,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Supply Station has two cards.</font>

744
00:27:30,360 --> 00:27:31,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One of them lets you trace one of the islanders'</font>

745
00:27:31,720 --> 00:27:34,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">previous delivery...</font>

746
00:27:34,080 --> 00:27:34,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

747
00:27:34,600 --> 00:27:34,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Records.</font>

748
00:27:34,960 --> 00:27:36,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can we go every day?</font>

749
00:27:36,240 --> 00:27:37,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just yesterday.</font>

750
00:27:37,000 --> 00:27:37,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only once yesterday.</font>

751
00:27:42,000 --> 00:27:43,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. How could you vote like that?</font>

752
00:27:43,880 --> 00:27:45,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My heart that just came alive</font>

753
00:27:45,720 --> 00:27:46,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">died a little inside again.</font>

754
00:27:47,880 --> 00:27:50,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, I voted for you every single time, didn't I?</font>

755
00:27:50,000 --> 00:27:51,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then why wasn't I the one with the most votes?</font>

756
00:27:51,880 --> 00:27:52,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Why didn't I get the most votes?]
You did.</font>

757
00:27:52,560 --> 00:27:53,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I wasn't.</font>

758
00:27:53,280 --> 00:27:53,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, you were.</font>

759
00:27:53,720 --> 00:27:54,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wasn't.</font>

760
00:27:54,200 --> 00:27:55,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On which day weren't you?</font>

761
00:27:57,640 --> 00:27:59,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think about it yourself. Seriously.</font>

762
00:28:09,000 --> 00:28:09,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[It was every day, whispering]
Every single day.</font>

763
00:28:12,600 --> 00:28:13,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So insincere.</font>

764
00:28:13,800 --> 00:28:14,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you serious?</font>

765
00:28:14,920 --> 00:28:15,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are so insincere when you talk.</font>

766
00:28:15,680 --> 00:28:16,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Bickering like kids]
You're the insincere one.</font>

767
00:28:16,400 --> 00:28:17,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're not sincere at all.</font>

768
00:28:17,120 --> 00:28:18,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're the insincere one.</font>

769
00:28:18,080 --> 00:28:18,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Way too insincere.</font>

770
00:28:18,840 --> 00:28:19,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that so?</font>

771
00:28:19,640 --> 00:28:20,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The way I talk to you now,</font>

772
00:28:20,320 --> 00:28:21,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't do that anymore, okay?</font>

773
00:28:21,560 --> 00:28:22,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

774
00:28:22,400 --> 00:28:23,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Way too insincere.</font>

775
00:28:23,000 --> 00:28:24,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then seriously speaking,</font>

776
00:28:24,040 --> 00:28:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you number one?</font>

777
00:28:25,240 --> 00:28:25,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

778
00:28:27,960 --> 00:28:28,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

779
00:28:28,920 --> 00:28:30,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[No]
How much more obvious can I be?</font>

780
00:28:31,120 --> 00:28:31,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

781
00:28:36,960 --> 00:28:38,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then shall we team up</font>

782
00:28:38,160 --> 00:28:38,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this afternoon?</font>

783
00:28:39,040 --> 00:28:42,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Asking to team up]</font>

784
00:28:44,200 --> 00:28:45,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The day before yesterday,</font>

785
00:28:45,560 --> 00:28:46,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you sat right here and said the exact same thing.</font>

786
00:28:46,920 --> 00:28:48,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You said, "Shall we team up tomorrow?"</font>

787
00:28:48,560 --> 00:28:50,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Night of day 2]
Shall we team up again tomorrow?</font>

788
00:28:50,160 --> 00:28:50,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

789
00:28:50,800 --> 00:28:52,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll choose you again tomorrow, okay?</font>

790
00:28:52,920 --> 00:28:53,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Day 3 team selection]</font>

791
00:28:53,600 --> 00:28:54,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Tianqing.</font>

792
00:28:56,360 --> 00:28:58,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't taking photos teaming up?</font>

793
00:28:58,200 --> 00:28:59,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That part...</font>

794
00:28:59,240 --> 00:29:00,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is also teaming up.</font>

795
00:29:00,600 --> 00:29:03,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then you tell me, how was I supposed to choose?</font>

796
00:29:03,040 --> 00:29:04,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I tell you how to choose?</font>

797
00:29:04,840 --> 00:29:06,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do I really need to tell you that?</font>

798
00:29:06,640 --> 00:29:08,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then when I didn't know how to make a choice,</font>

799
00:29:08,240 --> 00:29:10,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">shouldn't I just leave it to chance?</font>

800
00:29:10,600 --> 00:29:11,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave it to fate, huh?</font>

801
00:29:11,440 --> 00:29:12,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah,</font>

802
00:29:14,120 --> 00:29:14,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it was mostly fine,</font>

803
00:29:16,080 --> 00:29:17,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but deep down,</font>

804
00:29:17,000 --> 00:29:18,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I still felt a little annoyed.</font>

805
00:29:18,560 --> 00:29:20,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just that</font>

806
00:29:20,240 --> 00:29:23,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my dating experience is limited,</font>

807
00:29:23,040 --> 00:29:25,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I've never been firmly chosen.</font>

808
00:29:25,320 --> 00:29:26,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

809
00:29:26,400 --> 00:29:27,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Felt a bit let down.</font>

810
00:29:33,640 --> 00:29:35,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, tell me, why were you angry?</font>

811
00:29:36,560 --> 00:29:37,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because another thing is...</font>

812
00:29:37,840 --> 00:29:39,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There was some anger involved.</font>

813
00:29:39,000 --> 00:29:40,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We were in a little fight.</font>

814
00:29:40,960 --> 00:29:41,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I see.</font>

815
00:29:41,480 --> 00:29:41,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

816
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:43,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So tell me, why exactly were you mad?</font>

817
00:29:43,160 --> 00:29:44,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides, I feel like</font>

818
00:29:44,320 --> 00:29:45,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm the only one taking it seriously.</font>

819
00:29:45,520 --> 00:29:46,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You didn't seem to care at all</font>

820
00:29:46,680 --> 00:29:47,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or take it to heart.</font>

821
00:29:47,880 --> 00:29:49,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Was it because I joked around too much?</font>

822
00:29:52,520 --> 00:29:52,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

823
00:29:54,800 --> 00:29:56,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because that day you said,</font>

824
00:29:56,040 --> 00:29:58,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"How do you know I like you?"</font>

825
00:29:58,760 --> 00:29:59,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then how do you know...</font>

826
00:29:59,880 --> 00:30:02,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"How do you know I like you?"</font>

827
00:30:02,160 --> 00:30:02,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, was that it?</font>

828
00:30:04,920 --> 00:30:07,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just meant that</font>

829
00:30:08,520 --> 00:30:10,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we were still somewhere between</font>

830
00:30:10,200 --> 00:30:11,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">fondness and interest.</font>

831
00:30:13,880 --> 00:30:15,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are we supposed to talk about whether we like each other</font>

832
00:30:15,040 --> 00:30:15,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on the second day?</font>

833
00:30:15,760 --> 00:30:16,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're not there yet.</font>

834
00:30:18,520 --> 00:30:20,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then on the third day, are you going to talk about</font>

835
00:30:20,520 --> 00:30:23,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">firmly committing?</font>

836
00:30:23,360 --> 00:30:26,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think sometimes I really just said it</font>

837
00:30:26,360 --> 00:30:27,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in a playful way.</font>

838
00:30:27,920 --> 00:30:28,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that so?</font>

839
00:30:28,560 --> 00:30:31,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. And you kind of misunderstood me.</font>

840
00:30:31,320 --> 00:30:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You totally misunderstood me.</font>

841
00:30:32,320 --> 00:30:33,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's a huge misunderstanding</font>

842
00:30:33,280 --> 00:30:35,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">between the two of us,</font>

843
00:30:35,680 --> 00:30:36,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">okay?</font>

844
00:30:37,080 --> 00:30:38,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's work through this step by step, can we?</font>

845
00:30:38,880 --> 00:30:39,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

846
00:30:39,240 --> 00:30:40,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can we be more sincere with each other?</font>

847
00:30:40,320 --> 00:30:41,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hope you can see</font>

848
00:30:41,160 --> 00:30:42,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my sincere side, okay?</font>

849
00:30:42,960 --> 00:30:43,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Starting today.</font>

850
00:30:55,200 --> 00:30:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know why I decided to make up with you today?</font>

851
00:30:58,120 --> 00:30:59,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because I feel like,</font>

852
00:30:59,280 --> 00:31:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">although your tone often feels</font>

853
00:31:01,160 --> 00:31:03,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">very frivolous,</font>

854
00:31:03,960 --> 00:31:05,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your actions have always</font>

855
00:31:05,040 --> 00:31:07,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">backed up</font>

856
00:31:08,640 --> 00:31:10,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what you say.</font>

857
00:31:10,080 --> 00:31:11,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Actions back up words]
Yeah, definitely.</font>

858
00:31:11,440 --> 00:31:14,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told you my tone was just a bit frivolous,</font>

859
00:31:14,560 --> 00:31:17,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but the content of your words is untrustworthy.</font>

860
00:31:18,520 --> 00:31:20,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I guess we're about even.</font>

861
00:31:20,760 --> 00:31:22,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know what you're teasing me about.</font>

862
00:31:28,160 --> 00:31:29,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So we're good now?</font>

863
00:31:29,000 --> 00:31:29,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[So we're good now]
We're good.</font>

864
00:31:33,600 --> 00:31:34,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're good.</font>

865
00:31:34,760 --> 00:31:35,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not mad anymore.</font>

866
00:31:37,400 --> 00:31:38,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's give it our all this afternoon,</font>

867
00:31:38,320 --> 00:31:39,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's a competition.</font>

868
00:31:40,520 --> 00:31:40,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Deal.</font>

869
00:31:42,840 --> 00:31:46,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I felt a little spark again,</font>

870
00:31:46,000 --> 00:31:49,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when I was already feeling pretty bruised.</font>

871
00:31:49,240 --> 00:31:52,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[More points for her]
She scored major points with me.</font>

872
00:31:54,000 --> 00:31:54,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

873
00:31:56,920 --> 00:31:58,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you want to win?</font>

874
00:31:58,240 --> 00:32:00,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to win. I want to go on a date.</font>

875
00:32:00,560 --> 00:32:01,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Date who?</font>

876
00:32:02,200 --> 00:32:03,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually, I already have an answer in mind,</font>

877
00:32:03,640 --> 00:32:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but I'm not gonna tell you.</font>

878
00:32:05,360 --> 00:32:07,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If this kind of situation happens a third time,</font>

879
00:32:07,840 --> 00:32:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my heart will turn completely cold.</font>

880
00:32:09,080 --> 00:32:11,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I'll go into my villain era.</font>

881
00:32:12,360 --> 00:32:13,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happens when you go dark?</font>

882
00:32:13,760 --> 00:32:14,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you gonna scare me to death?</font>

883
00:32:14,960 --> 00:32:18,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you gonna go from meow to rawr?</font>

884
00:32:18,320 --> 00:32:19,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, I'm going to the dark side.</font>

885
00:32:24,840 --> 00:32:25,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Written all over his face]</font>

886
00:32:25,720 --> 00:32:27,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's up? In a good mood again?</font>

887
00:32:27,640 --> 00:32:28,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back to life.</font>

888
00:32:30,320 --> 00:32:31,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Swaggering]
Smiling again</font>

889
00:32:34,680 --> 00:32:36,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Can't keep a straight face]</font>

890
00:32:36,560 --> 00:32:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop playing it cool.</font>

891
00:32:39,800 --> 00:32:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not smiling.</font>

892
00:32:40,840 --> 00:32:41,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're not smiling? You're literally strutting as you walk.</font>

893
00:32:41,920 --> 00:32:43,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not smiling?</font>

894
00:32:43,560 --> 00:32:44,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stay pessimistic, okay?</font>

895
00:32:44,720 --> 00:32:46,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone, stay pessimistic.</font>

896
00:32:46,120 --> 00:32:48,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the only truth I've learned</font>

897
00:32:48,080 --> 00:32:49,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in my four days on this show.</font>

898
00:32:49,400 --> 00:32:50,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stay pessimistic.</font>

899
00:32:50,080 --> 00:32:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Stay pessimistic]</font>

900
00:32:51,800 --> 00:32:53,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you think someone can really have a flippant tone,</font>

901
00:32:53,640 --> 00:32:55,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but what they're saying is actually the truth?</font>

902
00:32:55,840 --> 00:32:59,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Cai Ziyi]
I think cheerful people really do that.</font>

903
00:32:59,480 --> 00:33:00,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

904
00:33:00,520 --> 00:33:01,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You mean using a joke</font>

905
00:33:01,960 --> 00:33:03,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to say how you really feel?</font>

906
00:33:03,560 --> 00:33:06,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, for example, if he's afraid of embarrassing himself or something,</font>

907
00:33:06,680 --> 00:33:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he'll just use a flippant tone to brush it off.</font>

908
00:33:11,200 --> 00:33:13,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel like this misunderstanding cannot be resolved merely through words.</font>

909
00:33:13,200 --> 00:33:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We need to spend more time together to slowly untangle it.</font>

910
00:33:16,640 --> 00:33:18,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I still have this lingering doubt in me.</font>

911
00:33:23,600 --> 00:33:25,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Arena of Affection is about to open.</font>

912
00:33:25,920 --> 00:33:28,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Arena of Affection opens]
Islanders, head to the arena.</font>

913
00:33:28,880 --> 00:33:29,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm nervous.</font>

914
00:33:29,720 --> 00:33:31,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm really, really nervous.</font>

915
00:33:31,080 --> 00:33:33,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">People who want to win don't smile.</font>

916
00:33:34,240 --> 00:33:34,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yang,</font>

917
00:33:34,520 --> 00:33:36,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can you carry me to victory today?</font>

918
00:33:36,400 --> 00:33:37,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stay pessimistic.</font>

919
00:33:37,560 --> 00:33:38,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to repeat this to myself</font>

920
00:33:38,080 --> 00:33:39,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">300 times today.</font>

921
00:33:39,600 --> 00:33:40,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have a secret.</font>

922
00:33:40,920 --> 00:33:44,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Preparing victory speech in advance]
Everyone here is an amateur.</font>

923
00:33:44,160 --> 00:33:45,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I win the championship today,</font>

924
00:33:45,520 --> 00:33:46,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that's what I'll say.</font>

925
00:33:46,280 --> 00:33:48,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I team up with you and we win, we'll shout it together.</font>

926
00:33:49,920 --> 00:33:51,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Time to gather.</font>

927
00:33:51,400 --> 00:33:53,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Approaching Liu Yuning]</font>

928
00:33:53,440 --> 00:33:55,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Smells so good. What is that scent?</font>

929
00:33:56,120 --> 00:33:59,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Source of the scent]</font>

930
00:33:59,400 --> 00:34:00,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me spray some of your cologne.</font>

931
00:34:01,600 --> 00:34:02,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want Ally</font>

932
00:34:02,040 --> 00:34:03,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to smell a different scent on me.</font>

933
00:34:06,680 --> 00:34:08,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[All dressed up]</font>

934
00:34:11,560 --> 00:34:12,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[A surprise prepared for you]</font>

935
00:34:12,160 --> 00:34:13,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait, it's you again?</font>

936
00:34:13,880 --> 00:34:15,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pretty soon it'll just smell like your sweat.</font>

937
00:34:15,600 --> 00:34:17,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Can practically smell it already]</font>

938
00:34:17,360 --> 00:34:17,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way.</font>

939
00:34:17,920 --> 00:34:19,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's gonna ferment.</font>

940
00:34:19,160 --> 00:34:20,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you know my sweat smells nice?</font>

941
00:34:20,600 --> 00:34:21,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Sweet-scented sweat]
Sweet-smelling baby.</font>

942
00:34:21,280 --> 00:34:23,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So gross. Get away.</font>

943
00:34:25,880 --> 00:34:27,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today's game is no joke.</font>

944
00:34:27,640 --> 00:34:28,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is already set up.</font>

945
00:34:40,000 --> 00:34:42,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really wanna see if it's legit.</font>

946
00:34:42,240 --> 00:34:43,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Doing pull-ups,</font>

947
00:34:43,640 --> 00:34:44,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">bro.</font>

948
00:34:44,480 --> 00:34:45,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[No way.]</font>

949
00:34:45,600 --> 00:34:47,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't do this.</font>

950
00:34:47,200 --> 00:34:48,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How many pull-ups can you do?</font>

951
00:34:48,320 --> 00:34:49,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Probably twenty.</font>

952
00:34:49,520 --> 00:34:50,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is impossible for me.</font>

953
00:34:50,440 --> 00:34:51,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really can't do this.</font>

954
00:34:51,120 --> 00:34:52,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't even do a single one.</font>

955
00:34:52,040 --> 00:34:52,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't this right up your alley,</font>

956
00:34:52,960 --> 00:34:53,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianqing?</font>

957
00:34:53,720 --> 00:34:54,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Confident]
At least twenty.</font>

958
00:34:57,840 --> 00:34:59,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello, islanders.</font>

959
00:34:59,840 --> 00:35:02,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chen Shuyue, Tobe Lei,</font>

960
00:35:02,120 --> 00:35:03,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">since you are new islanders,</font>

961
00:35:03,880 --> 00:35:05,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your initial survival points</font>

962
00:35:05,280 --> 00:35:08,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will be the average of all islanders: twelve.</font>

963
00:35:08,040 --> 00:35:08,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Twelve?</font>

964
00:35:08,920 --> 00:35:10,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Twelve puts them in third place.</font>

965
00:35:10,240 --> 00:35:13,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Twelve is higher than us. Twelve?</font>

966
00:35:13,320 --> 00:35:14,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My apologies.</font>

967
00:35:14,480 --> 00:35:17,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I single-handedly raised the average for everyone.</font>

968
00:35:17,040 --> 00:35:19,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Huang Siyang: 20 survival points]
How do you have twenty?</font>

969
00:35:19,320 --> 00:35:20,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I even spent some points.</font>

970
00:35:20,680 --> 00:35:22,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Splurged big time yesterday.</font>

971
00:35:22,960 --> 00:35:24,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wang Sheng: 4 survival points]
Why does Wang Sheng only have 4 points?</font>

972
00:35:25,640 --> 00:35:26,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Spent too much today.</font>

973
00:35:26,760 --> 00:35:28,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[All in for a Flower Room pass]
It's a bit pricey.</font>

974
00:35:30,320 --> 00:35:32,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This round's challenge is a team battle.</font>

975
00:35:32,360 --> 00:35:33,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After this challenge,</font>

976
00:35:33,960 --> 00:35:35,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the winning team</font>

977
00:35:35,160 --> 00:35:37,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can visit the Supply Station of Affection,</font>

978
00:35:37,480 --> 00:35:39,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and each member will get ten survival points.</font>

979
00:35:39,960 --> 00:35:42,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Second place: five survival points each.</font>

980
00:35:42,000 --> 00:35:44,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Third place: three survival points each.</font>

981
00:35:44,280 --> 00:35:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The rest of the islanders will get two survival points each.</font>

982
00:35:46,640 --> 00:35:49,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today, four competitive teams will be drawn.</font>

983
00:35:49,360 --> 00:35:51,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Each team will consist of two male</font>

984
00:35:51,040 --> 00:35:52,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and two female islanders.</font>

985
00:35:52,720 --> 00:35:54,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those who draw the same colored ball</font>

986
00:35:54,160 --> 00:35:56,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will be partners for today.</font>

987
00:35:57,400 --> 00:35:58,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's totally random.</font>

988
00:35:58,280 --> 00:35:58,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on,</font>

989
00:35:58,640 --> 00:35:59,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let's draw.</font>

990
00:36:10,160 --> 00:36:11,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Heard you're really good.</font>

991
00:36:13,040 --> 00:36:14,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's check the score.</font>

992
00:36:14,400 --> 00:36:16,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tobe Lei and I both happened to draw blue,</font>

993
00:36:16,560 --> 00:36:17,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so we're on the same team.</font>

994
00:36:17,600 --> 00:36:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm actually pretty happy about it.</font>

995
00:36:21,520 --> 00:36:23,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Green.</font>

996
00:36:23,320 --> 00:36:24,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey there.</font>

997
00:36:24,800 --> 00:36:25,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gao, you're on the green team too?</font>

998
00:36:25,880 --> 00:36:26,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah,</font>

999
00:36:26,960 --> 00:36:28,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">quite a coincidence. Since this should be my</font>

1000
00:36:28,200 --> 00:36:29,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">second time teaming up with Xinran.</font>

1001
00:36:29,680 --> 00:36:31,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's all familiar faces,</font>

1002
00:36:31,440 --> 00:36:34,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I feel it's a very comfortable group for me.</font>

1003
00:36:34,560 --> 00:36:35,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Being drawn into the same team?</font>

1004
00:36:35,800 --> 00:36:37,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course I'm not happy.</font>

1005
00:36:38,160 --> 00:36:40,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With him next to me, I'll be under so much pressure.</font>

1006
00:36:42,600 --> 00:36:44,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Yellow: Wang Tianqing, Zheng Shoudong]
[Ren Chunxi, Qian Shihan]</font>

1007
00:36:44,560 --> 00:36:45,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you do pull-ups?</font>

1008
00:36:45,720 --> 00:36:46,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Girls definitely don't have to do it, right?</font>

1009
00:36:46,880 --> 00:36:48,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can only hang there.</font>

1010
00:36:48,960 --> 00:36:50,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just making small talk for the sake of it, bro.</font>

1011
00:36:51,360 --> 00:36:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[His little scheme got exposed]</font>

1012
00:36:57,680 --> 00:37:00,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Liang Yongfeng looks for his pink teammate]</font>

1013
00:37:00,280 --> 00:37:00,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

1014
00:37:00,960 --> 00:37:01,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Greeting]
Hi.</font>

1015
00:37:03,120 --> 00:37:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wang Sheng is also on the pink team]</font>

1016
00:37:06,520 --> 00:37:07,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Dodging eye contact]</font>

1017
00:37:08,160 --> 00:37:09,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Dodging eye contact]</font>

1018
00:37:19,520 --> 00:37:20,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I always thought</font>

1019
00:37:20,280 --> 00:37:22,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the two of them were a mutual pick.</font>

1020
00:37:22,400 --> 00:37:24,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But when they teamed up,</font>

1021
00:37:24,480 --> 00:37:26,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they were so quiet and didn't speak.</font>

1022
00:37:26,640 --> 00:37:27,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At the time, I assumed they were a bit moody,</font>

1023
00:37:27,200 --> 00:37:29,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">having a little fight.</font>

1024
00:37:32,600 --> 00:37:37,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Team results] [Green team, blue team, yellow team, pink team]</font>

1025
00:37:38,000 --> 00:37:39,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before the official mission begins,</font>

1026
00:37:39,480 --> 00:37:40,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we will have an</font>

1027
00:37:40,800 --> 00:37:42,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Advantage Match",</font>

1028
00:37:42,080 --> 00:37:43,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">an Arm Strength Challenge.</font>

1029
00:37:43,520 --> 00:37:45,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Each team sends one of their male islanders</font>

1030
00:37:45,200 --> 00:37:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for a pull-up showdown.</font>

1031
00:37:46,640 --> 00:37:48,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once your feet touch the ground, the challenge ends.</font>

1032
00:37:48,280 --> 00:37:50,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The team with the highest count wins.</font>

1033
00:37:50,120 --> 00:37:51,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So simple and brutal.</font>

1034
00:37:51,600 --> 00:37:54,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I like how straightforward this is.</font>

1035
00:37:54,200 --> 00:37:56,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Male islanders participating from each team, please raise your hands.</font>

1036
00:37:56,720 --> 00:37:57,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Green team: Gao Yuheng]</font>

1037
00:37:57,520 --> 00:37:58,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gao Yuheng.</font>

1038
00:37:58,840 --> 00:38:00,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Yellow team: Wang Tianqing]
Wang Tianqing.</font>

1039
00:38:00,640 --> 00:38:01,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Pink team: Wang Sheng]
Wang Sheng.</font>

