00:46:01,560 --> 00:46:02,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go for it.</font>

1212
00:46:02,760 --> 00:46:03,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just get on.</font>

1213
00:46:06,000 --> 00:46:06,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Losing balance.]</font>

1214
00:46:06,640 --> 00:46:07,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Careful.</font>

1215
00:46:08,360 --> 00:46:08,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Crossed the starting line]</font>

1216
00:46:08,960 --> 00:46:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have to restart.</font>

1217
00:46:11,280 --> 00:46:12,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My bad.</font>

1218
00:46:13,040 --> 00:46:14,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Blue team returns to the starting line and restarts]</font>

1219
00:46:14,080 --> 00:46:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on. You're fine.</font>

1220
00:46:14,720 --> 00:46:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, let's start again.</font>

1221
00:46:16,040 --> 00:46:17,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

1222
00:46:18,080 --> 00:46:19,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A bit further is fine.</font>

1223
00:46:19,040 --> 00:46:20,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Pink team takes a slight lead]</font>

1224
00:46:24,800 --> 00:46:25,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Girls go first.</font>

1225
00:46:26,480 --> 00:46:27,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Getting on the barrel]
Are you good?</font>

1226
00:46:28,000 --> 00:46:28,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You go.</font>

1227
00:46:28,920 --> 00:46:30,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me a hand.</font>

1228
00:46:30,080 --> 00:46:31,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll hold you later if you need me to.</font>

1229
00:46:34,120 --> 00:46:35,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let her go straight up. You go first.</font>

1230
00:46:38,520 --> 00:46:40,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move the plank forward first. Hold onto this.</font>

1231
00:46:40,280 --> 00:46:41,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[On-site commander]
I'm getting on this plank.</font>

1232
00:46:41,120 --> 00:46:42,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two need to squeeze onto the first barrel.</font>

1233
00:46:42,160 --> 00:46:43,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me come up.</font>

1234
00:46:43,400 --> 00:46:45,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I realized Feng is really smart.</font>

1235
00:46:45,040 --> 00:46:46,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He was just</font>

1236
00:46:46,480 --> 00:46:48,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">teaching us how to do this and that,</font>

1237
00:46:48,000 --> 00:46:49,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">totally calm and collected.</font>

1238
00:46:51,040 --> 00:46:52,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Pink team all up on the barrels]
Right, keep moving forward.</font>

1239
00:46:52,080 --> 00:46:52,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be careful.</font>

1240
00:46:52,640 --> 00:46:53,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Step on the plank.</font>

1241
00:46:53,360 --> 00:46:54,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll move this.</font>

1242
00:46:54,240 --> 00:46:55,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Their team is so fast.]</font>

1243
00:46:58,760 --> 00:47:00,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Too scared to stand up]
I'm scared to go over.</font>

1244
00:47:01,160 --> 00:47:03,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's okay. You can just step right across.</font>

1245
00:47:04,040 --> 00:47:05,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Attempting to stand up]</font>

1246
00:47:05,520 --> 00:47:06,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be careful, don't fall.</font>

1247
00:47:07,800 --> 00:47:08,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Attempt failed]</font>

1248
00:47:08,840 --> 00:47:09,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Scared of heights?</font>

1249
00:47:09,480 --> 00:47:10,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A little bit.</font>

1250
00:47:11,680 --> 00:47:13,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Terrified by a single meter]</font>

1251
00:47:13,720 --> 00:47:15,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Holding hands]
Careful. Come on.</font>

1252
00:47:27,800 --> 00:47:29,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chen Shuyue kept being scared</font>

1253
00:47:29,520 --> 00:47:30,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and didn't dare to come up.</font>

1254
00:47:30,320 --> 00:47:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I found it really cute.</font>

1255
00:47:34,480 --> 00:47:37,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[No one to help me, bouncing on my own]</font>

1256
00:47:39,040 --> 00:47:39,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You go ahead.</font>

1257
00:47:41,640 --> 00:47:43,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Blue team all up on the barrels]</font>

1258
00:47:43,600 --> 00:47:45,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's not watch this group. They're too slow.</font>

1259
00:47:45,160 --> 00:47:47,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Nothing to learn here]
Let's go watch the other side.</font>

1260
00:47:47,280 --> 00:47:49,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're not learning anything here.</font>

1261
00:47:49,200 --> 00:47:51,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, they seem pretty all over the place.</font>

1262
00:47:51,040 --> 00:47:52,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're playing it smarter.</font>

1263
00:47:53,160 --> 00:47:54,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Lifting it right up]</font>

1264
00:47:54,800 --> 00:47:55,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Put it right in front.</font>

1265
00:47:57,880 --> 00:47:58,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good.</font>

1266
00:47:59,600 --> 00:48:00,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Striding over]</font>

1267
00:48:01,120 --> 00:48:03,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Blue team moving slowly]</font>

1268
00:48:03,000 --> 00:48:03,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're doomed.</font>

1269
00:48:03,760 --> 00:48:04,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's just drag it.</font>

1270
00:48:04,600 --> 00:48:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Inching forward]</font>

1271
00:48:09,320 --> 00:48:10,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

1272
00:48:10,320 --> 00:48:10,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take it easy.</font>

1273
00:48:11,800 --> 00:48:12,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Pink team is way ahead]
How are they so fast?</font>

1274
00:48:13,880 --> 00:48:14,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Use your feet for the far ones.</font>

1275
00:48:14,600 --> 00:48:15,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can push off with your feet.</font>

1276
00:48:17,880 --> 00:48:19,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Great footwork.</font>

1277
00:48:19,120 --> 00:48:20,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Looking over there won't help us.</font>

1278
00:48:20,400 --> 00:48:21,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're almost at the finish line.</font>

1279
00:48:21,560 --> 00:48:23,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Approaching the finish line]</font>

1280
00:48:23,200 --> 00:48:24,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can't you just jump right over?</font>

1281
00:48:24,760 --> 00:48:25,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can we just jump past the red line?</font>

1282
00:48:25,960 --> 00:48:27,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, as long as you get across.</font>

1283
00:48:27,120 --> 00:48:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gao,</font>

1284
00:48:27,720 --> 00:48:28,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't make me jump. I'm scared.</font>

1285
00:48:28,960 --> 00:48:29,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know how to jump.</font>

1286
00:48:29,720 --> 00:48:31,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's okay. Safety comes first.</font>

1287
00:48:31,880 --> 00:48:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wang Sheng reaches the stage 1 finish line]</font>

1288
00:48:32,400 --> 00:48:34,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, come to this side.</font>

1289
00:48:34,160 --> 00:48:36,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jump forward.</font>

1290
00:48:36,440 --> 00:48:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Zhang Yi finishes stage 1]
Nice.</font>

1291
00:48:36,840 --> 00:48:37,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nice.</font>

1292
00:48:37,320 --> 00:48:37,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Careful now.</font>

1293
00:48:43,120 --> 00:48:44,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Reaching out]</font>

1294
00:48:51,520 --> 00:48:52,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take it easy.</font>

1295
00:48:55,240 --> 00:48:56,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Pink team completes stage 1]
Careful.</font>

1296
00:48:56,280 --> 00:48:56,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry to the next stage.</font>

1297
00:48:56,880 --> 00:48:58,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go, quick.</font>

1298
00:48:58,760 --> 00:48:59,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Next stage.</font>

1299
00:48:59,160 --> 00:49:00,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

1300
00:49:00,720 --> 00:49:02,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How are they so fast?</font>

1301
00:49:02,200 --> 00:49:02,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Over there.</font>

1302
00:49:04,160 --> 00:49:06,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Zhang Yi picks Liang Yongfeng as her stage 2 partner]</font>

1303
00:49:25,600 --> 00:49:26,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No,</font>

1304
00:49:26,120 --> 00:49:26,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can't reach it like that.</font>

1305
00:49:26,960 --> 00:49:28,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Distance is too far]
Shoulders.</font>

1306
00:49:30,840 --> 00:49:31,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

1307
00:49:31,280 --> 00:49:33,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can I put in some shoe lifts right now?</font>

1308
00:49:34,640 --> 00:49:36,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bro, are you kidding me?</font>

1309
00:49:36,400 --> 00:49:37,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Height really helps here.</font>

1310
00:49:37,600 --> 00:49:39,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's 1.7 meters tall. She'll do fine.</font>

1311
00:49:39,160 --> 00:49:40,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really, I think she's the tallest girl here.</font>

1312
00:49:40,400 --> 00:49:40,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If that doesn't work,</font>

1313
00:49:40,880 --> 00:49:41,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll have to lift her up.</font>

1314
00:49:41,600 --> 00:49:43,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think that'll do it.</font>

1315
00:49:43,120 --> 00:49:44,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Blue team nears stage 1 finish]
Can you jump?</font>

1316
00:49:44,240 --> 00:49:45,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can do it.</font>

1317
00:49:45,480 --> 00:49:46,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, come on.</font>

1318
00:49:46,360 --> 00:49:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be careful. Take your time.</font>

1319
00:49:48,720 --> 00:49:50,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Tobe Lei reaches the stage 1 finish line]</font>

1320
00:49:50,040 --> 00:49:50,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just jump. You'll be fine.</font>

1321
00:49:50,760 --> 00:49:52,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He'll let you through.</font>

1322
00:49:52,320 --> 00:49:53,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

1323
00:49:53,360 --> 00:49:54,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Chen Shuyue finishes stage 1]
Yes.</font>

1324
00:49:55,520 --> 00:49:57,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Hu Ke'er reaches the stage 1 finish line]</font>

1325
00:49:57,320 --> 00:49:58,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Blue team completes stage 1]
Charge.</font>

1326
00:49:58,160 --> 00:49:59,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

1327
00:49:59,200 --> 00:50:00,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Both teams are neck and neck]
Us on the left, you on the right.</font>

1328
00:50:00,760 --> 00:50:01,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Grab the ball, let's go.</font>

1329
00:50:01,600 --> 00:50:02,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Pink team is still stuck on stage 2]</font>

1330
00:50:02,560 --> 00:50:03,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ziyi isn't tall enough.</font>

1331
00:50:03,240 --> 00:50:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'd better have her put both feet here.</font>

1332
00:50:05,560 --> 00:50:06,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, are you okay with this?</font>

1333
00:50:06,680 --> 00:50:07,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ride on my shoulders, alright?</font>

1334
00:50:08,160 --> 00:50:08,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

1335
00:50:08,640 --> 00:50:11,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Trying again]</font>

1336
00:50:13,280 --> 00:50:14,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you handle it?</font>

1337
00:50:15,760 --> 00:50:17,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Climb up.</font>

1338
00:50:17,280 --> 00:50:18,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit tight.</font>

1339
00:50:18,000 --> 00:50:19,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

1340
00:50:19,200 --> 00:50:19,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This works.</font>

1341
00:50:19,800 --> 00:50:20,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems a bit more stable like this.</font>

1342
00:50:20,520 --> 00:50:21,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems to work.</font>

1343
00:50:22,600 --> 00:50:23,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold onto me.</font>

1344
00:50:24,160 --> 00:50:25,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Supporting her head]</font>

1345
00:50:29,040 --> 00:50:29,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Song.</font>

1346
00:50:29,400 --> 00:50:31,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why don't you get on his shoulders too?</font>

1347
00:50:31,360 --> 00:50:32,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Using the same method]
I'll get on too.</font>

1348
00:50:34,640 --> 00:50:35,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, hop on.</font>

1349
00:50:35,640 --> 00:50:36,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll hop on.</font>

1350
00:50:36,640 --> 00:50:37,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hop on.</font>

1351
00:50:37,000 --> 00:50:37,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This way.</font>

1352
00:50:39,960 --> 00:50:41,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Step back a little.</font>

1353
00:50:41,680 --> 00:50:43,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move back. Both of you, move back a bit.</font>

1354
00:50:47,640 --> 00:50:49,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forward or backward?</font>

1355
00:50:49,080 --> 00:50:49,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nice.</font>

1356
00:50:50,640 --> 00:50:51,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Pink team clears stage 2]
Good.</font>

1357
00:50:51,360 --> 00:50:54,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good. You can come down now.</font>

1358
00:50:54,880 --> 00:50:55,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That works.</font>

1359
00:50:55,960 --> 00:50:57,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry to the next stage. Next stage.</font>

1360
00:50:57,840 --> 00:50:58,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep going.</font>

1361
00:50:58,720 --> 00:50:59,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take it easy.</font>

1362
00:50:59,400 --> 00:51:00,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Pink team starts stage 3]</font>

1363
00:51:00,920 --> 00:51:02,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Blue team is still on stage 2]</font>

1364
00:51:02,400 --> 00:51:02,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it okay if you sit on my shoulders?</font>

1365
00:51:02,960 --> 00:51:04,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That works too.</font>

1366
00:51:04,080 --> 00:51:04,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

1367
00:51:06,200 --> 00:51:07,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be careful.</font>

1368
00:51:09,040 --> 00:51:10,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">3, 2, 1.</font>

1369
00:51:19,360 --> 00:51:20,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can I let go? You good?</font>

1370
00:51:24,400 --> 00:51:24,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Blue team clears stage 2]</font>

1371
00:51:24,960 --> 00:51:26,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All set.</font>

1372
00:51:26,640 --> 00:51:27,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All set. Let's go.</font>

1373
00:51:27,240 --> 00:51:28,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it.</font>

1374
00:51:31,800 --> 00:51:33,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Pink team takes the lead]
Guys, go first.</font>

1375
00:51:45,800 --> 00:51:46,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pull me when you cross this.</font>

1376
00:51:46,920 --> 00:51:48,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't pull her, pull me.</font>

1377
00:51:48,520 --> 00:51:48,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

1378
00:51:48,760 --> 00:51:50,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Blue team also starts stage 3]
Same formation as before.</font>

1379
00:51:50,400 --> 00:51:50,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

1380
00:51:58,640 --> 00:52:00,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Held securely]</font>

1381
00:52:03,120 --> 00:52:05,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just do two bridal carries and walk right through.</font>

1382
00:52:05,320 --> 00:52:07,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh no, what if my feet are too big?</font>

1383
00:52:07,280 --> 00:52:08,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think taking off our shoes would help.</font>

1384
00:52:08,840 --> 00:52:10,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Feet too big, the log can't fit them both.]</font>

1385
00:52:10,200 --> 00:52:11,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Works for me.</font>

1386
00:52:11,120 --> 00:52:13,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Gentleman's hands]</font>

1387
00:52:15,000 --> 00:52:15,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good thing my feet are small.</font>

1388
00:52:15,800 --> 00:52:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mine aren't that big either.</font>

1389
00:52:16,640 --> 00:52:17,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's your shoe size?</font>

1390
00:52:17,400 --> 00:52:17,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">43.</font>

1391
00:52:17,960 --> 00:52:19,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">43? I'm a 42.5.</font>

1392
00:52:19,400 --> 00:52:21,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">42.5? Your feet are that small?</font>

1393
00:52:21,680 --> 00:52:22,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We were too poor growing up.</font>

1394
00:52:22,880 --> 00:52:23,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Broke]</font>

1395
00:52:23,320 --> 00:52:23,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I was growing up,</font>

1396
00:52:23,960 --> 00:52:25,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they only let me wear 42.5.</font>

1397
00:52:25,040 --> 00:52:26,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They wouldn't let me buy bigger ones.</font>

1398
00:52:26,000 --> 00:52:27,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Foot-binding, huh?</font>

1399
00:52:28,400 --> 00:52:29,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Turns out my shoes are just too big.</font>

1400
00:52:29,480 --> 00:52:32,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Taking off shoes]</font>

1401
00:52:32,480 --> 00:52:33,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Going all out, huh? Even taking off your shoes.</font>

1402
00:52:33,960 --> 00:52:35,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Relax, white socks.</font>

1403
00:52:35,000 --> 00:52:36,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry. Hurry up.</font>

1404
00:52:37,000 --> 00:52:39,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Pink team passes the halfway mark]</font>

1405
00:52:44,120 --> 00:52:45,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take it easy.</font>

1406
00:52:53,200 --> 00:52:54,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Shaking]</font>

1407
00:52:54,360 --> 00:52:55,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can go.</font>

1408
00:52:55,720 --> 00:52:57,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Crowded]
Stop pushing. I'm almost there.</font>

1409
00:52:57,400 --> 00:52:57,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pull me.</font>

1410
00:52:57,840 --> 00:52:59,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">3, 2, 1.</font>

1411
00:53:02,560 --> 00:53:03,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Pink team reaches the last log]</font>

1412
00:53:06,840 --> 00:53:07,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, stand steady.</font>

1413
00:53:11,920 --> 00:53:12,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wang Sheng reaches the finish line]
Hurry up.</font>

1414
00:53:15,640 --> 00:53:16,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Cai Ziyi reaches the finish line]
Jump over the red line.</font>

1415
00:53:17,560 --> 00:53:18,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Zhang Yi reaches the finish line]
Jump over.</font>

1416
00:53:18,440 --> 00:53:18,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We won.</font>

1417
00:53:19,720 --> 00:53:22,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Pink team completes the challenge. Time: 15m 11s]</font>

1418
00:53:23,800 --> 00:53:25,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Awesome.</font>

1419
00:53:25,120 --> 00:53:26,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Great teamwork.</font>

1420
00:53:27,680 --> 00:53:28,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bring it in.</font>

1421
00:53:28,160 --> 00:53:29,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fist bump, fist bump.</font>

1422
00:53:33,000 --> 00:53:33,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nice.</font>

1423
00:53:41,120 --> 00:53:42,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Medic.</font>

1424
00:53:42,560 --> 00:53:43,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

1425
00:53:43,240 --> 00:53:44,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Iodophor]
We need iodophor.</font>

1426
00:53:44,440 --> 00:53:45,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it.</font>

1427
00:53:48,680 --> 00:53:49,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who?</font>

1428
00:53:49,080 --> 00:53:49,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He got hurt.</font>

1429
00:53:51,240 --> 00:53:52,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me see where you're hurt.</font>

1430
00:53:53,560 --> 00:53:54,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your leg is scraped a bit.</font>

1431
00:53:54,640 --> 00:53:57,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[When did he get hurt?]</font>

1432
00:53:58,360 --> 00:53:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Bumped against the wooden barrel]</font>

1433
00:53:59,880 --> 00:54:01,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Bumped against the wooden barrel]</font>

1434
00:54:02,600 --> 00:54:03,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is your leg scraped too?</font>

1435
00:54:03,680 --> 00:54:05,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, yours.</font>

1436
00:54:05,160 --> 00:54:05,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You mean mine?</font>

1437
00:54:09,920 --> 00:54:11,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine, just a quick wipe-off will do.</font>

1438
00:54:11,120 --> 00:54:12,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have a seat and rest a bit.</font>

1439
00:54:13,800 --> 00:54:14,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one really noticed</font>

1440
00:54:14,920 --> 00:54:16,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that I hurt my leg.</font>

1441
00:54:16,520 --> 00:54:17,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But right after the match ended, Cai Ziyi</font>

1442
00:54:17,800 --> 00:54:20,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">said she'd go get some iodophor.</font>

1443
00:54:20,800 --> 00:54:23,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was actually really touched by that.</font>

1444
00:54:23,720 --> 00:54:25,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Passing water to Wang Sheng]</font>

1445
00:54:27,160 --> 00:54:27,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

1446
00:54:34,160 --> 00:54:36,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Blue team is still going]</font>

1447
00:54:36,120 --> 00:54:37,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually, a one-minute gap makes a difference.</font>

1448
00:54:37,600 --> 00:54:38,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at the two of them.</font>

1449
00:54:38,920 --> 00:54:40,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The difference is only about a minute.</font>

1450
00:54:40,600 --> 00:54:42,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I think we'll be faster than them.</font>

1451
00:54:42,440 --> 00:54:43,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think so too.</font>

1452
00:54:43,120 --> 00:54:44,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We took notes from them.</font>

1453
00:54:44,520 --> 00:54:46,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take your time, no rush.</font>

1454
00:54:46,360 --> 00:54:47,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't fall.</font>

1455
00:54:48,080 --> 00:54:49,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The highest one is cleared.</font>

1456
00:54:49,160 --> 00:54:50,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

1457
00:54:53,120 --> 00:54:55,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Holding hands]</font>

1458
00:54:55,080 --> 00:54:56,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chen Shuyue left a deep impression on me.</font>

1459
00:54:56,280 --> 00:54:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We completed a lot of challenges</font>

1460
00:54:59,040 --> 00:54:59,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">together in the arena,</font>

1461
00:54:59,880 --> 00:55:01,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I had the chance</font>

1462
00:55:01,240 --> 00:55:03,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to interact more closely with everyone</font>

1463
00:55:03,200 --> 00:55:05,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I could get a better look at her.</font>

1464
00:55:05,200 --> 00:55:06,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She has a very Korean style.</font>

1465
00:55:07,160 --> 00:55:07,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really pretty.</font>

1466
00:55:08,560 --> 00:55:11,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Protective embrace]</font>

1467
00:55:18,400 --> 00:55:19,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

1468
00:55:19,320 --> 00:55:20,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Careful. It's a bit of a gap.</font>

1469
00:55:20,160 --> 00:55:22,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jump across. I'll just jump across.</font>

1470
00:55:22,040 --> 00:55:22,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can I make that jump?</font>

1471
00:55:23,520 --> 00:55:24,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Tobe Lei reaches the finish line]</font>

1472
00:55:25,840 --> 00:55:27,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, just jump across.</font>

1473
00:55:27,720 --> 00:55:28,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Chen Shuyue reaches the finish line]
Made it.</font>

1474
00:55:31,120 --> 00:55:32,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Blue team completes the challenge with a time of 17:34]</font>

1475
00:55:32,920 --> 00:55:33,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Awesome.</font>

1476
00:55:33,640 --> 00:55:34,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fantastic.</font>

1477
00:55:34,640 --> 00:55:35,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Great job, everyone. Really well done.</font>

1478
00:55:35,960 --> 00:55:36,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Way to go.</font>

1479
00:55:36,680 --> 00:55:37,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You really went all out.</font>

1480
00:55:37,400 --> 00:55:38,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Outstanding.</font>

1481
00:55:38,560 --> 00:55:41,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All islanders competing in the second half, please take your positions.</font>

1482
00:55:41,040 --> 00:55:41,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on. You're fine.</font>

1483
00:55:41,880 --> 00:55:44,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

1484
00:55:47,040 --> 00:55:48,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master Yang, watch this.</font>

1485
00:55:48,120 --> 00:55:49,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep it up.</font>

1486
00:55:49,320 --> 00:55:50,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd love to see you get first place for once, will ya?</font>

1487
00:55:54,000 --> 00:55:54,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't even want first place.</font>

1488
00:55:56,000 --> 00:55:57,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Too painful to recall]
That last date</font>

1489
00:55:58,520 --> 00:55:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was way too traumatizing.</font>

1490
00:56:00,960 --> 00:56:01,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

1491
00:56:01,520 --> 00:56:02,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, high five.</font>

1492
00:56:02,200 --> 00:56:02,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">High five.</font>

1493
00:56:02,840 --> 00:56:04,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Team Green, Team Green, the greenest team ever.</font>

1494
00:56:06,000 --> 00:56:07,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Round 2 green team VS yellow team]</font>

1495
00:56:11,200 --> 00:56:12,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Match starts]</font>

1496
00:56:13,960 --> 00:56:14,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you get up there?</font>

1497
00:56:15,080 --> 00:56:15,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't. It's too far.</font>

1498
00:56:16,520 --> 00:56:17,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you make it up on your own?</font>

1499
00:56:18,840 --> 00:56:20,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Light as a feather]</font>

1500
00:56:25,440 --> 00:56:25,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Careful.</font>

1501
00:56:25,800 --> 00:56:26,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep it steady.</font>

1502
00:56:26,600 --> 00:56:27,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Steady is our game.</font>

1503
00:56:28,400 --> 00:56:31,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Yellow team places their board first]</font>

1504
00:56:31,200 --> 00:56:31,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do we need to get on this?</font>

1505
00:56:35,240 --> 00:56:38,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Easily steps onto the barrel]</font>

1506
00:56:38,120 --> 00:56:38,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We don't need the boards.</font>

1507
00:56:38,920 --> 00:56:39,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Green team abandons the boards]
You guys can get on.</font>

1508
00:56:39,320 --> 00:56:40,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need for boards,</font>

1509
00:56:40,280 --> 00:56:41,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just get on.</font>

1510
00:56:43,680 --> 00:56:44,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Struggling to climb up]</font>

1511
00:56:44,160 --> 00:56:44,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Careful.</font>

1512
00:56:46,240 --> 00:56:47,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just sit down, no need to stand.</font>

1513
00:56:47,600 --> 00:56:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just sit down.</font>

1514
00:56:48,360 --> 00:56:49,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here, just slide right over.</font>

1515
00:56:49,240 --> 00:56:51,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[How do I get up?]</font>

1516
00:56:51,960 --> 00:56:53,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Lifts her right up]</font>

1517
00:56:58,320 --> 00:57:00,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Happy]</font>

1518
00:57:00,240 --> 00:57:01,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is so much fun.</font>

1519
00:57:01,480 --> 00:57:03,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Scared]</font>

1520
00:57:03,040 --> 00:57:04,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bring it over, yeah.</font>

1521
00:57:05,360 --> 00:57:06,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Both standing on one barrel]</font>

1522
00:57:10,800 --> 00:57:11,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit down, get settled.</font>

1523
00:57:11,880 --> 00:57:12,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You take half.</font>

1524
00:57:12,960 --> 00:57:13,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Confused]
Okay, sure.</font>

1525
00:57:13,960 --> 00:57:14,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is that team doing?</font>

1526
00:57:14,600 --> 00:57:15,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's going on?</font>

1527
00:57:15,480 --> 00:57:16,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They don't even want the boards.</font>

1528
00:57:16,800 --> 00:57:18,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Crammed together]
Are they really gonna cram four people</font>

1529
00:57:18,000 --> 00:57:19,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">onto two barrels?</font>

1530
00:57:19,320 --> 00:57:20,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cheating schemes.</font>

1531
00:57:22,040 --> 00:57:22,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are they doing?</font>

1532
00:57:24,440 --> 00:57:25,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are they even doing?</font>

1533
00:57:26,560 --> 00:57:27,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Laser-focused on the task]</font>

1534
00:57:30,600 --> 00:57:32,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Passing the wooden barrel between the three of them]</font>

1535
00:57:32,920 --> 00:57:33,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Team commands]
A bit further. Further.</font>

1536
00:57:33,600 --> 00:57:34,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it.</font>

1537
00:57:34,960 --> 00:57:35,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Put it in the middle.</font>

1538
00:57:35,960 --> 00:57:36,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

1539
00:57:38,400 --> 00:57:40,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Yellow team is currently in the lead]</font>

1540
00:57:40,120 --> 00:57:41,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually, over there they're not as fast as here.</font>

1541
00:57:44,720 --> 00:57:46,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel like all three of them are really smart.</font>

1542
00:57:46,600 --> 00:57:49,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone completely understands</font>

1543
00:57:49,080 --> 00:57:51,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">each other's ideas and opinions.</font>

1544
00:57:51,480 --> 00:57:52,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

1545
00:57:52,200 --> 00:57:54,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Cooperating closely, moving swiftly]
They're controlling their distance well.</font>

1546
00:57:54,280 --> 00:57:55,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Perfectly aligned.</font>

1547
00:57:55,880 --> 00:57:58,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Stuck in place]
They're starting in order over there.</font>

1548
00:57:59,400 --> 00:58:00,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Struggling to move the barrel]
Move forward. Take it slow.</font>

1549
00:58:00,760 --> 00:58:02,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[All about a chill mindset]
Yeah, we just need to take our time.</font>

1550
00:58:04,240 --> 00:58:05,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Moving it a bit]
This distance is about right.</font>

1551
00:58:05,080 --> 00:58:06,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I love playing it this way.</font>

1552
00:58:06,760 --> 00:58:07,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, exactly.</font>

