<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

1897
01:10:20,400 --> 01:10:21,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Boys.</font>

1898
01:10:21,120 --> 01:10:21,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Men.</font>

1899
01:10:21,560 --> 01:10:22,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Male]
Male.</font>

1900
01:10:22,640 --> 01:10:24,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wouldn't call them boys. More like...</font>

1901
01:10:24,040 --> 01:10:26,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Men or boys?]
Somewhere between a man and a boy.</font>

1902
01:10:26,360 --> 01:10:27,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

1903
01:10:27,480 --> 01:10:28,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's not exactly old.</font>

1904
01:10:28,760 --> 01:10:29,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

1905
01:10:29,400 --> 01:10:32,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But he's no puppy-eyed kid either.</font>

1906
01:10:32,040 --> 01:10:33,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[+1 For discipline]
And he's really disciplined.</font>

1907
01:10:33,760 --> 01:10:34,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[That's exactly her type]
Yeah.</font>

1908
01:10:37,720 --> 01:10:39,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're finally off Team Two Points.</font>

1909
01:10:39,400 --> 01:10:40,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Congrats.</font>

1910
01:10:40,240 --> 01:10:41,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Finally, more than 2 points.</font>

1911
01:10:43,920 --> 01:10:45,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Yogurt for Hu Ke'er]
Want some yogurt?</font>

1912
01:10:45,680 --> 01:10:46,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's cold.</font>

1913
01:10:46,280 --> 01:10:47,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For real?</font>

1914
01:10:47,040 --> 01:10:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ice cold.</font>

1915
01:10:47,520 --> 01:10:48,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

1916
01:10:48,240 --> 01:10:48,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course.</font>

1917
01:10:48,680 --> 01:10:49,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about you?</font>

1918
01:10:49,280 --> 01:10:50,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've had some.</font>

1919
01:10:50,160 --> 01:10:51,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's split it.</font>

1920
01:10:52,680 --> 01:10:55,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He handed me a bottle of yogurt.</font>

1921
01:10:55,120 --> 01:10:57,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was happy and a little surprised.</font>

1922
01:10:57,160 --> 01:10:58,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those little gestures</font>

1923
01:10:58,480 --> 01:11:00,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">really make me happy.</font>

1924
01:11:00,240 --> 01:11:02,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And it felt so natural, too.</font>

1925
01:11:05,880 --> 01:11:18,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Date zone]</font>

1926
01:11:22,480 --> 01:11:27,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Early for the date]</font>

1927
01:11:34,960 --> 01:11:37,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've got a fever. It's 38.9°C.</font>

1928
01:11:37,360 --> 01:11:39,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Running a fever]</font>

1929
01:11:39,640 --> 01:11:42,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Liu Yuning has a fever of 38.9°C]</font>

1930
01:11:52,960 --> 01:11:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[I think I have a fever]</font>

1931
01:11:55,600 --> 01:11:56,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A fever.</font>

1932
01:11:58,640 --> 01:11:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll be okay.</font>

1933
01:11:59,520 --> 01:12:01,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get some sleep first.</font>

1934
01:12:01,200 --> 01:12:02,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll see if they have medicine.</font>

1935
01:12:06,880 --> 01:12:08,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, producer?</font>

1936
01:12:08,000 --> 01:12:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do we have anything for a cold or fever?</font>

1937
01:12:10,960 --> 01:12:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll get the medics</font>

1938
01:12:12,040 --> 01:12:13,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to check on Liu Yuning.</font>

1939
01:12:13,040 --> 01:12:13,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her fever's really high.</font>

1940
01:12:19,160 --> 01:12:20,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, isn't she feeling sick?</font>

1941
01:12:20,840 --> 01:12:22,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Asking about Liu Yuning]
How high is her fever?</font>

1942
01:12:22,480 --> 01:12:23,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">39°C.</font>

1943
01:12:23,200 --> 01:12:24,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">39°C? Okay.</font>

1944
01:12:24,280 --> 01:12:26,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wang Tianqing checks on Liu Yuning]
Then the date's off, of course.</font>

1945
01:12:26,040 --> 01:12:28,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Calls off the date]
Could I maybe</font>

1946
01:12:28,200 --> 01:12:29,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">bring her some medicine or something?</font>

1947
01:12:29,600 --> 01:12:31,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's had medicine and a cooling patch.</font>

1948
01:12:31,720 --> 01:12:33,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's probably asleep now, right?</font>

1949
01:12:33,800 --> 01:12:34,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's resting.</font>

1950
01:12:34,760 --> 01:12:35,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

1951
01:12:35,160 --> 01:12:36,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't bother her right now.</font>

1952
01:12:36,960 --> 01:12:39,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When she wakes up,</font>

1953
01:12:39,000 --> 01:12:40,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could you come and...</font>

1954
01:12:40,760 --> 01:12:41,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll tell you.</font>

1955
01:12:41,160 --> 01:12:41,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right. Come get me.</font>

1956
01:12:41,640 --> 01:12:42,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I'll go check on her.</font>

1957
01:12:42,800 --> 01:12:43,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Will do.</font>

1958
01:12:43,280 --> 01:12:44,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

1959
01:12:55,800 --> 01:12:56,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go take care of her.</font>

1960
01:13:02,680 --> 01:13:04,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Staff]</font>

1961
01:13:07,160 --> 01:13:08,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Feeling any better?</font>

1962
01:13:10,000 --> 01:13:10,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you take her temperature?</font>

1963
01:13:10,760 --> 01:13:13,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, we both checked just now.</font>

1964
01:13:13,320 --> 01:13:14,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's check again.</font>

1965
01:13:14,840 --> 01:13:16,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong? Feeling dizzy?</font>

1966
01:13:19,080 --> 01:13:21,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When we were at the arena,</font>

1967
01:13:21,040 --> 01:13:23,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I noticed she looked</font>

1968
01:13:23,800 --> 01:13:25,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a little pale around the lips and seemed off.</font>

1969
01:13:25,880 --> 01:13:27,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was worried that if I went in,</font>

1970
01:13:27,040 --> 01:13:28,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd just disturb her.</font>

1971
01:13:28,760 --> 01:13:31,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wanted to let her rest, too.</font>

1972
01:13:31,240 --> 01:13:32,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I decided to go in after all</font>

1973
01:13:32,640 --> 01:13:34,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and let her know I cared.</font>

1974
01:13:37,440 --> 01:13:38,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your face still feels warm.</font>

1975
01:13:39,080 --> 01:13:39,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is a little warm.</font>

1976
01:13:39,800 --> 01:13:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[You make me warm]
You make me warm.</font>

1977
01:13:41,960 --> 01:13:43,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really? Am I blushing?</font>

1978
01:13:45,360 --> 01:13:46,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's call it a day, okay?</font>

1979
01:13:46,840 --> 01:13:48,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm here with you now.</font>

1980
01:13:48,280 --> 01:13:49,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone else can go.</font>

1981
01:13:51,360 --> 01:13:54,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He came to see me when I had a fever.</font>

1982
01:13:54,160 --> 01:13:55,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He even cracked a few jokes</font>

1983
01:13:55,880 --> 01:13:58,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to help me relax.</font>

1984
01:13:58,040 --> 01:13:59,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was really touched.</font>

1985
01:14:01,240 --> 01:14:03,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When did you start feeling sick? This afternoon?</font>

1986
01:14:03,760 --> 01:14:04,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm okay. I really am.</font>

1987
01:14:04,960 --> 01:14:05,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really, I'm fine.</font>

1988
01:14:07,480 --> 01:14:08,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm here. Your fever's gone.</font>

1989
01:14:14,560 --> 01:14:15,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do I have a date today?</font>

1990
01:14:16,760 --> 01:14:17,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know.</font>

1991
01:14:17,680 --> 01:14:19,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Probably not, I think.</font>

1992
01:14:19,040 --> 01:14:21,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think she wants you to make the first move.</font>

1993
01:14:24,920 --> 01:14:27,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who would I be going out with today?</font>

1994
01:14:27,080 --> 01:14:28,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way. I didn't win today.</font>

1995
01:14:28,120 --> 01:14:29,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shihan won, right?</font>

1996
01:14:29,320 --> 01:14:29,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, she won.</font>

1997
01:14:29,840 --> 01:14:30,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shihan won.</font>

1998
01:14:30,680 --> 01:14:32,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you said you didn't have a date.</font>

1999
01:14:35,320 --> 01:14:38,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gao Yuheng, please head to the date zone.</font>

2000
01:14:38,680 --> 01:14:39,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Me?</font>

2001
01:14:41,000 --> 01:14:43,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gao's got a date.</font>

2002
01:14:43,480 --> 01:14:44,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Thrilled]</font>

2003
01:14:46,640 --> 01:14:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The pieces fit.</font>

2004
01:14:51,040 --> 01:14:52,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who is it? Annie, right?</font>

2005
01:14:52,840 --> 01:14:53,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Annie.</font>

2006
01:14:53,760 --> 01:14:54,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, Annie.</font>

2007
01:14:55,080 --> 01:14:56,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Hands in pockets]</font>

2008
01:14:56,880 --> 01:14:58,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look, both hands in his pockets.</font>

2009
01:14:58,320 --> 01:15:01,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at that little strut.</font>

2010
01:15:01,640 --> 01:15:02,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's loving it.</font>

2011
01:15:02,040 --> 01:15:03,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Can't hide his smile]</font>

2012
01:15:03,200 --> 01:15:03,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was pretty happy</font>

2013
01:15:03,840 --> 01:15:05,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because Shihan is the one I like.</font>

2014
01:15:05,880 --> 01:15:07,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was looking forward to</font>

2015
01:15:07,280 --> 01:15:08,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">some one-on-one time with her.</font>

2016
01:15:12,640 --> 01:15:15,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Qian Shihan isn't heading to the date zone?]</font>

2017
01:15:17,240 --> 01:15:18,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's going, but she isn't.</font>

2018
01:15:23,960 --> 01:15:25,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A date for one.</font>

2019
01:15:25,160 --> 01:15:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Annie isn't going.</font>

2020
01:15:26,160 --> 01:15:27,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's still in her room.</font>

2021
01:15:32,240 --> 01:15:32,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait a second.</font>

2022
01:15:32,680 --> 01:15:33,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who was the other girl today?</font>

2023
01:15:35,200 --> 01:15:35,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xixi.</font>

2024
01:15:36,000 --> 01:15:37,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Ren Chunxi also gets to pick a date]</font>

2025
01:15:37,560 --> 01:15:39,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did Xixi pick him?</font>

2026
01:15:39,880 --> 01:15:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is Xixi in there?</font>

2027
01:15:44,600 --> 01:15:45,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know.</font>

2028
01:15:48,920 --> 01:15:50,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That doesn't seem likely.</font>

2029
01:15:55,720 --> 01:15:56,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way. Go look.</font>

2030
01:15:56,880 --> 01:15:57,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is Xixi in there?</font>

2031
01:16:01,720 --> 01:16:03,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wasn't it you who asked Gao out?</font>

2032
01:16:03,840 --> 01:16:05,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Staff]
I don't know.</font>

2033
01:16:09,720 --> 01:16:10,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

2034
01:16:10,440 --> 01:16:11,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Staff]
Gao's gone on his date,</font>

2035
01:16:11,320 --> 01:16:12,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you're sitting here.</font>

2036
01:16:12,240 --> 01:16:13,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm stunned.</font>

2037
01:16:15,920 --> 01:16:16,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Staff]
Xixi picked him.</font>

2038
01:16:17,800 --> 01:16:19,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gao Yuheng and Xixi are on a date?</font>

2039
01:16:19,440 --> 01:16:20,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seriously?</font>

2040
01:16:20,360 --> 01:16:21,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's hilarious.</font>

2041
01:16:26,280 --> 01:16:27,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Staff]
I thought he was meeting you.</font>

2042
01:16:27,560 --> 01:16:28,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then you opened the door.</font>

2043
01:16:28,440 --> 01:16:30,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was like, what's the leading lady doing here?</font>

2044
01:16:42,120 --> 01:16:42,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who are you meeting?</font>

2045
01:16:42,920 --> 01:16:44,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Better pick up the pace.</font>

2046
01:16:44,680 --> 01:16:47,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Ren Chunxi is already seated]</font>

2047
01:16:47,600 --> 01:16:48,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's my table?</font>

2048
01:16:49,920 --> 01:16:51,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Over here.</font>

2049
01:16:51,080 --> 01:16:52,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit here.</font>

2050
01:16:54,640 --> 01:16:55,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You picked me?</font>

2051
01:16:56,680 --> 01:16:57,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

2052
01:16:59,960 --> 01:17:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Messing with me again, huh?</font>

2053
01:17:02,280 --> 01:17:02,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Surprise.</font>

2054
01:17:03,760 --> 01:17:08,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Ren Chunxi's date: Gao Yuheng]</font>

2055
01:17:08,920 --> 01:17:10,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Trying to make someone jealous?</font>

2056
01:17:10,240 --> 01:17:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not.</font>

2057
01:17:12,800 --> 01:17:13,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wasn't that surprised,</font>

2058
01:17:13,920 --> 01:17:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or anything like that.</font>

2059
01:17:14,720 --> 01:17:15,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just thought,</font>

2060
01:17:15,560 --> 01:17:16,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wow, it isn't Qian Shihan.</font>

2061
01:17:20,360 --> 01:17:21,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is wild.</font>

2062
01:17:22,240 --> 01:17:23,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's all over the place.</font>

2063
01:17:23,720 --> 01:17:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a mess.</font>

2064
01:17:26,160 --> 01:17:27,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's total chaos.</font>

2065
01:17:28,760 --> 01:17:29,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But it makes sense.</font>

2066
01:17:29,440 --> 01:17:31,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">People still want to get to know each other.</font>

2067
01:17:33,680 --> 01:17:34,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I remember asking her</font>

2068
01:17:34,760 --> 01:17:35,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if there were any other guys</font>

2069
01:17:35,480 --> 01:17:37,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she wanted to get to know.</font>

2070
01:17:37,160 --> 01:17:38,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She told me no.</font>

2071
01:17:38,760 --> 01:17:41,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[A little upset]
So I was a little upset.</font>

2072
01:17:41,400 --> 01:17:42,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought maybe she</font>

2073
01:17:43,160 --> 01:17:45,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wanted to talk to some other guys.</font>

2074
01:17:45,200 --> 01:17:46,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But it's her choice.</font>

2075
01:17:46,960 --> 01:17:47,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's free to do what she wants.</font>

2076
01:17:50,080 --> 01:17:51,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's okay.</font>

2077
01:17:51,200 --> 01:17:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's okay.</font>

2078
01:17:55,640 --> 01:17:57,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here he comes.</font>

2079
01:17:57,200 --> 01:17:58,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No wonder</font>

2080
01:17:58,760 --> 01:17:59,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xixi said today</font>

2081
01:17:59,400 --> 01:18:00,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we were in for a surprise.</font>

2082
01:18:00,920 --> 01:18:03,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xixi picked him.</font>

2083
01:18:03,160 --> 01:18:04,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We thought it was you.</font>

2084
01:18:04,680 --> 01:18:06,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I haven't had my date yet.</font>

2085
01:18:06,640 --> 01:18:07,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xixi?</font>

2086
01:18:07,160 --> 01:18:08,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why would she ask Gao out?</font>

2087
01:18:08,720 --> 01:18:09,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No idea.</font>

2088
01:18:09,560 --> 01:18:11,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe there wasn't anyone else she wanted to pick.</font>

2089
01:18:11,120 --> 01:18:11,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe it's just for fun.</font>

2090
01:18:11,960 --> 01:18:13,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gao's fun to hang out with.</font>

2091
01:18:13,040 --> 01:18:14,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It wouldn't be awkward.</font>

2092
01:18:14,680 --> 01:18:17,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right. Just friends catching up.</font>

2093
01:18:23,240 --> 01:18:24,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I keep thinking, why me?</font>

2094
01:18:27,080 --> 01:18:28,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well...</font>

2095
01:18:28,160 --> 01:18:30,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't want to pick anyone today,</font>

2096
01:18:31,360 --> 01:18:33,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but I had to.</font>

2097
01:18:33,080 --> 01:18:34,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I don't want to make the first move again.</font>

2098
01:18:34,760 --> 01:18:36,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Done making the first move]
So I didn't pick him.</font>

2099
01:18:36,080 --> 01:18:37,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, you look great today.</font>

2100
01:18:37,360 --> 01:18:39,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It'd be a shame to skip the date.</font>

2101
01:18:39,040 --> 01:18:40,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I look great every day.</font>

2102
01:18:41,720 --> 01:18:42,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

2103
01:18:42,720 --> 01:18:44,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why'd you hesitate?</font>

2104
01:18:44,200 --> 01:18:45,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's that supposed to mean?</font>

2105
01:18:45,560 --> 01:18:46,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly what I said.</font>

2106
01:18:46,600 --> 01:18:49,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I get the feeling he doesn't</font>

2107
01:18:49,000 --> 01:18:50,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">really like</font>

2108
01:18:50,880 --> 01:18:52,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">anything this formal anyway.</font>

2109
01:18:54,200 --> 01:18:55,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I didn't want to ask him again.</font>

2110
01:18:56,200 --> 01:18:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, I get it.</font>

2111
01:18:58,120 --> 01:18:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want him to make the first move.</font>

2112
01:18:58,960 --> 01:19:00,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think he should ask you out too.</font>

2113
01:19:00,440 --> 01:19:01,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not trying to make him.</font>

2114
01:19:01,000 --> 01:19:02,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You shouldn't have to say anything.</font>

2115
01:19:02,560 --> 01:19:03,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I won't.</font>

2116
01:19:03,240 --> 01:19:04,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right. I won't go around saying,</font>

2117
01:19:04,640 --> 01:19:05,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">like,</font>

2118
01:19:05,600 --> 01:19:06,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Ren Chunxi wants you to ask her out."</font>

2119
01:19:06,840 --> 01:19:08,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just feel</font>

2120
01:19:08,240 --> 01:19:11,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've done my part.</font>

2121
01:19:11,720 --> 01:19:12,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you picked me, though,</font>

2122
01:19:12,320 --> 01:19:13,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what happens with me and Shihan?</font>

2123
01:19:13,720 --> 01:19:15,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wants a date with Qian Shihan]</font>

2124
01:19:15,240 --> 01:19:16,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does that mean Shihan can't pick me?</font>

2125
01:19:17,120 --> 01:19:17,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She can.</font>

2126
01:19:17,600 --> 01:19:18,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She can?</font>

2127
01:19:18,120 --> 01:19:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This has nothing to do with it.</font>

2128
01:19:19,960 --> 01:19:20,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm all mixed up.</font>

2129
01:19:20,520 --> 01:19:21,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today I really</font>

2130
01:19:21,440 --> 01:19:22,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">didn't want anything romantic</font>

2131
01:19:22,720 --> 01:19:24,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[No romance today]
with any of the guys.</font>

2132
01:19:24,120 --> 01:19:25,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing romantic, I mean.</font>

2133
01:19:25,680 --> 01:19:27,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Then what am I?]</font>

2134
01:19:27,280 --> 01:19:28,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You didn't want a guy,</font>

2135
01:19:28,040 --> 01:19:29,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so you picked me?</font>

2136
01:19:31,320 --> 01:19:32,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What does that make me?</font>

2137
01:19:33,120 --> 01:19:34,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm one of the girls, right?</font>

2138
01:19:35,360 --> 01:19:36,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're all friends.</font>

2139
01:19:36,400 --> 01:19:37,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I mean I didn't want</font>

2140
01:19:37,640 --> 01:19:38,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a proper date with a guy.</font>

2141
01:19:38,920 --> 01:19:39,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know?</font>

2142
01:19:39,560 --> 01:19:40,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm tired.</font>

2143
01:19:40,120 --> 01:19:41,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yesterday I felt like</font>

2144
01:19:41,000 --> 01:19:42,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had to make conversation with too many guys.</font>

2145
01:19:42,580 --> 01:19:44,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[At ease]</font>

2146
01:19:44,800 --> 01:19:45,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here I can just be myself</font>

2147
01:19:45,440 --> 01:19:46,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and enjoy my food.</font>

2148
01:19:46,000 --> 01:19:47,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're killing my appetite.</font>

2149
01:19:47,920 --> 01:19:49,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can relax around you, right?</font>

2150
01:19:49,760 --> 01:19:51,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't have to try with you.</font>

2151
01:19:51,280 --> 01:19:52,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Or with Dong.</font>

2152
01:19:52,160 --> 01:19:53,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, of course.</font>

2153
01:19:53,760 --> 01:19:54,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Or with Siyang.</font>

2154
01:19:54,920 --> 01:19:55,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Talks a lot]
He talks way too much.</font>

2155
01:19:55,680 --> 01:19:56,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't be bothered with him.</font>

2156
01:19:56,680 --> 01:19:58,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Over the back-and-forth]
I can't keep going back and forth.</font>

2157
01:19:58,520 --> 01:19:59,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gao, though...</font>

2158
01:19:59,280 --> 01:20:00,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Too much back-and-forth]
He's really funny.</font>

2159
01:20:00,800 --> 01:20:02,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can have dinner with him</font>

2160
01:20:02,880 --> 01:20:04,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">without feeling any pressure.</font>

2161
01:20:04,080 --> 01:20:06,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can just enjoy the meal.</font>

2162
01:20:06,520 --> 01:20:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's eat.</font>

2163
01:20:08,240 --> 01:20:10,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Digging in]
Enjoy the spoils of victory.</font>

2164
01:20:13,000 --> 01:20:14,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Another big bite]</font>

2165
01:20:15,420 --> 01:20:16,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[And another]</font>

2166
01:20:16,960 --> 01:20:19,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Going all in]</font>

2167
01:20:19,840 --> 01:20:21,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Still going]</font>

2168
01:20:23,000 --> 01:20:25,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Here for the food]</font>

2169
01:20:25,480 --> 01:20:26,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have some more.</font>

2170
01:20:26,320 --> 01:20:27,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you have another date later,</font>

2171
01:20:27,920 --> 01:20:29,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you probably won't eat like this.</font>

2172
01:20:29,960 --> 01:20:30,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure I will.</font>

2173
01:20:30,200 --> 01:20:31,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can eat like this</font>

2174
01:20:31,480 --> 01:20:32,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">around Shihan now, too.</font>

2175
01:20:33,440 --> 01:20:34,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's good.</font>

2176
01:20:34,760 --> 01:20:36,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We hang out like friends.</font>

2177
01:20:36,640 --> 01:20:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

2178
01:20:37,240 --> 01:20:38,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That first day, though,</font>

2179
01:20:38,040 --> 01:20:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when it's that formal one-on-one,</font>

2180
01:20:40,840 --> 01:20:41,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know what to talk about.</font>

2181
01:20:41,680 --> 01:20:42,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know?</font>

2182
01:20:43,320 --> 01:20:44,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I get all stiff when it's too formal.</font>

2183
01:20:45,960 --> 01:20:46,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

2184
01:20:47,600 --> 01:20:48,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you asked</font>

2185
01:20:48,600 --> 01:20:50,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Qian Shihan's ideal type]
what Annie's type is?</font>

2186
01:20:50,040 --> 01:20:50,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

2187
01:20:51,880 --> 01:20:52,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why not?</font>

2188
01:20:53,840 --> 01:20:55,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't think it matters?</font>

2189
01:20:55,240 --> 01:20:56,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

2190
01:20:56,840 --> 01:20:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just treat her more like a friend.</font>

2191
01:20:58,120 --> 01:20:58,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't really said anything.</font>

2192
01:20:58,800 --> 01:20:59,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At first, of course, you see her</font>

2193
01:20:59,920 --> 01:21:00,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">through rose-colored glasses.</font>

2194
01:21:00,920 --> 01:21:02,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just think she's gorgeous.</font>

2195
01:21:02,080 --> 01:21:03,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I realized she's really funny.</font>

2196
01:21:03,040 --> 01:21:03,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I mean,</font>

2197
01:21:03,720 --> 01:21:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she's great.</font>

2198
01:21:04,400 --> 01:21:07,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once I stopped putting her on a pedestal,</font>

2199
01:21:07,120 --> 01:21:08,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it felt easier to be myself around her.</font>

2200
01:21:08,880 --> 01:21:10,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, it feels more natural that way.</font>

2201
01:21:13,960 --> 01:21:16,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When does our talent show start?</font>

2202
01:21:16,400 --> 01:21:17,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No idea.</font>

2203
01:21:17,480 --> 01:21:18,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's your talent?</font>

2204
01:21:19,200 --> 01:21:20,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dancing?</font>

2205
01:21:20,200 --> 01:21:22,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I picked piano.</font>

2206
01:21:22,640 --> 01:21:23,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Playing the piano]
Yep.</font>

2207
01:21:23,200 --> 01:21:24,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's a different side of you.</font>

2208
01:21:24,920 --> 01:21:26,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really want people to see that side of me.</font>

2209
01:21:26,360 --> 01:21:27,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Time to turn on the charm]</font>

2210
01:21:30,200 --> 01:21:31,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't played in 10 years,</font>

2211
01:21:31,440 --> 01:21:32,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I'm nothing special,</font>

2212
01:21:32,520 --> 01:21:33,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but people won't expect it from me.</font>

2213
01:21:37,760 --> 01:21:38,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And then there's the thing I worked on...</font>

2214
01:21:38,920 --> 01:21:40,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Love and Bread profile.</font>

2215
01:21:40,120 --> 01:21:41,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's that for?</font>

2216
01:21:41,320 --> 01:21:42,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Love and Bread, with care]
I put a lot of work into it.</font>

2217
01:21:42,640 --> 01:21:43,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A lot.</font>

2218
01:21:43,320 --> 01:21:44,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It took me 3 days and 3 nights.</font>

2219
01:21:44,880 --> 01:21:45,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now I'm curious.</font>

2220
01:21:45,880 --> 01:21:48,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If someone opens it later,</font>

2221
01:21:48,120 --> 01:21:50,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[A surprise for whoever looks]
I want it to be a surprise.</font>

2222
01:21:53,400 --> 01:21:54,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They didn't even give us napkins.</font>

2223
01:21:55,320 --> 01:21:57,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just wipe it on your shirt.</font>

2224
01:21:58,640 --> 01:21:59,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll use yours.</font>

2225
01:21:59,560 --> 01:22:01,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've got someone to see later.</font>

2226
01:22:01,640 --> 01:22:02,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't have another date.</font>

2227
01:22:02,640 --> 01:22:04,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Another date with Qian Shihan?]
I do have another date later.</font>

2228
01:22:04,040 --> 01:22:04,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shows what you know.</font>

2229
01:22:06,960 --> 01:22:08,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Onto round 2, huh?</font>

2230
01:22:08,720 --> 01:22:09,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd better eat my fill</font>

2231
01:22:09,720 --> 01:22:10,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I've got energy to talk later.</font>

2232
01:22:13,320 --> 01:22:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What Gao and I had</font>

2233
01:22:14,280 --> 01:22:15,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was just dinner.</font>

2234
01:22:15,160 --> 01:22:16,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wouldn't call it a date.</font>

2235
01:22:16,400 --> 01:22:17,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was really relaxed.</font>

2236
01:22:17,120 --> 01:22:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We could talk about anything.</font>

2237
01:22:19,560 --> 01:22:22,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It felt like we'd been friends for ages.</font>

2238
01:22:22,000 --> 01:22:24,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And the setting was pretty romantic.</font>

2239
01:22:29,360 --> 01:22:30,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't know we had</font>

2240
01:22:30,120 --> 01:22:31,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">such a beautiful spot here.</font>

2241
01:22:31,560 --> 01:22:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Flower Room.</font>

2242
01:22:37,440 --> 01:22:38,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is almost too pretty.</font>

2243
01:22:44,520 --> 01:22:45,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Flower Room is gorgeous.</font>

2244
