2352
01:26:37,640 --> 01:26:38,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I don't want that.</font>

2353
01:26:38,600 --> 01:26:40,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want you to keep giving in for me.</font>

2354
01:26:40,040 --> 01:26:41,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I don't want to keep giving in for you.</font>

2355
