<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or are you trying to...?</font>

2415
01:28:36,400 --> 01:28:37,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just wanted to</font>

2416
01:28:37,560 --> 01:28:39,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">tell you what I've been thinking.</font>

2417
01:28:46,960 --> 01:28:49,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She realized I had something to tell her,</font>

2418
01:28:49,640 --> 01:28:51,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Growing serious]
and she got more serious.</font>

2419
01:28:51,520 --> 01:28:53,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe I was being too serious myself.</font>

2420
01:28:53,440 --> 01:28:54,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wanted her to know</font>

2421
01:28:54,800 --> 01:28:56,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd really thought</font>

2422
01:28:56,240 --> 01:28:57,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this through</font>

2423
01:28:57,880 --> 01:28:59,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and that she matters to me.</font>

2424
01:29:01,000 --> 01:29:02,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When he said all that,</font>

2425
01:29:02,640 --> 01:29:04,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my heart sank a little.</font>

2426
01:29:04,720 --> 01:29:07,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe because of my past relationships,</font>

2427
01:29:07,000 --> 01:29:09,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was scared he was looking for</font>

2428
01:29:11,120 --> 01:29:13,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a way to stop seeing me</font>

2429
01:29:13,120 --> 01:29:14,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and needed an excuse.</font>

2430
01:29:14,560 --> 01:29:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I felt really let down.</font>

2431
01:29:22,600 --> 01:29:24,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why the sad smile?</font>

2432
01:29:24,520 --> 01:29:25,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, I get it.</font>

2433
01:29:25,680 --> 01:29:27,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I understand where you're coming from.</font>

2434
01:29:30,040 --> 01:29:31,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you think?</font>

2435
01:29:33,040 --> 01:29:34,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I said</font>

2436
01:29:34,720 --> 01:29:36,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd be up for whatever you wanted to do...</font>

2437
01:29:39,080 --> 01:29:39,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah?</font>

2438
01:29:39,960 --> 01:29:42,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Putting his mind at ease]
I don't feel like I'm giving in.</font>

2439
01:29:42,080 --> 01:29:44,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Or anything like that.</font>

2440
01:29:44,080 --> 01:29:44,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As long as it's</font>

2441
01:29:44,920 --> 01:29:47,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">within reason,</font>

2442
01:29:47,120 --> 01:29:49,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">whatever you want to do,</font>

2443
01:29:49,360 --> 01:29:50,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if you're good with it...</font>

2444
01:29:50,680 --> 01:29:51,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm good with it.</font>

2445
01:29:51,440 --> 01:29:53,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It doesn't feel like a sacrifice.</font>

2446
01:29:54,640 --> 01:29:56,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm actually someone who</font>

2447
01:29:56,880 --> 01:29:58,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">doesn't get out that much.</font>

2448
01:29:58,480 --> 01:30:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I do want to go out.</font>

2449
01:30:00,320 --> 01:30:02,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just don't have anyone to go with.</font>

2450
01:30:02,080 --> 01:30:02,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why I said</font>

2451
01:30:02,960 --> 01:30:03,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm up for whatever you want to do.</font>

2452
01:30:03,840 --> 01:30:05,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Open to new things]
I want to try new things.</font>

2453
01:30:08,480 --> 01:30:10,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just that when I'm on my own,</font>

2454
01:30:10,400 --> 01:30:12,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't always feel like doing much.</font>

2455
01:30:13,640 --> 01:30:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I get it.</font>

2456
01:30:14,280 --> 01:30:15,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When there's two of you,</font>

2457
01:30:15,480 --> 01:30:16,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're up for whatever.</font>

2458
01:30:16,600 --> 01:30:17,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

2459
01:30:17,600 --> 01:30:18,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I see.</font>

2460
01:30:20,880 --> 01:30:22,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you actually want</font>

2461
01:30:22,120 --> 01:30:23,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">someone to take you along.</font>

2462
01:30:25,240 --> 01:30:26,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I guess</font>

2463
01:30:26,120 --> 01:30:29,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm that kind of person, aren't I?</font>

2464
01:30:29,440 --> 01:30:30,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you think you are?</font>

2465
01:30:30,640 --> 01:30:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think so.</font>

2466
01:30:32,320 --> 01:30:34,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, there you go.</font>

2467
01:30:39,880 --> 01:30:42,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So did what I just said</font>

2468
01:30:44,280 --> 01:30:47,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">help put...</font>

2469
01:30:47,320 --> 01:30:48,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Any of my worries to rest?</font>

2470
01:30:48,480 --> 01:30:49,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

2471
01:30:51,400 --> 01:30:52,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be honest.</font>

2472
01:30:52,400 --> 01:30:53,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't overthink it.</font>

2473
01:30:54,800 --> 01:30:55,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Unsure]
I don't know.</font>

2474
01:30:55,240 --> 01:30:57,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I do feel a bit better.</font>

2475
01:31:07,000 --> 01:31:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is there anything else</font>

2476
01:31:09,080 --> 01:31:09,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're worried about?</font>

2477
01:31:09,680 --> 01:31:11,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Or do you need some time</font>

2478
01:31:11,080 --> 01:31:12,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to think it over on your own?</font>

2479
01:31:16,000 --> 01:31:16,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Still unsure]
I don't know either.</font>

2480
01:31:16,960 --> 01:31:18,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know what I'm worried about.</font>

2481
01:31:22,920 --> 01:31:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's mainly that when we talked yesterday,</font>

2482
01:31:25,240 --> 01:31:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I kept hearing</font>

2483
01:31:26,160 --> 01:31:28,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how different we are.</font>

2484
01:31:28,160 --> 01:31:29,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It made me nervous.</font>

2485
01:31:29,440 --> 01:31:31,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I worry that if we keep seeing each other,</font>

2486
01:31:31,760 --> 01:31:33,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'll end up fighting a lot</font>

2487
01:31:34,200 --> 01:31:35,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because we're</font>

2488
01:31:35,160 --> 01:31:37,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so different.</font>

2489
01:31:37,280 --> 01:31:37,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For instance,</font>

2490
01:31:39,040 --> 01:31:40,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I barely use my phone.</font>

2491
01:31:42,280 --> 01:31:44,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And, say,</font>

2492
01:31:44,200 --> 01:31:45,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't stay up late much either.</font>

2493
01:31:47,080 --> 01:31:48,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's lots of little things like that.</font>

2494
01:31:50,320 --> 01:31:51,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Still unsure]
I just don't know.</font>

2495
01:31:58,320 --> 01:31:59,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know myself pretty well.</font>

2496
01:31:59,880 --> 01:32:02,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have times when I get really down.</font>

2497
01:32:02,720 --> 01:32:03,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want a partner</font>

2498
01:32:03,960 --> 01:32:05,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who, when I'm feeling like that,</font>

2499
01:32:05,440 --> 01:32:07,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can give me a little push.</font>

2500
01:32:07,160 --> 01:32:10,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But with Hu Ke'er, I haven't seen</font>

2501
01:32:10,880 --> 01:32:12,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that she can do that for me.</font>

2502
01:32:14,200 --> 01:32:16,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If he'd kept that to himself,</font>

2503
01:32:16,280 --> 01:32:18,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it would've eaten away at him.</font>

2504
01:32:18,800 --> 01:32:19,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm actually glad</font>

2505
01:32:19,920 --> 01:32:21,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he was able to tell me directly.</font>

2506
01:32:21,400 --> 01:32:24,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But maybe because of my own feelings,</font>

2507
01:32:24,000 --> 01:32:26,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">after he said all that,</font>

2508
01:32:26,560 --> 01:32:28,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't really want to face him.</font>

2509
01:32:28,240 --> 01:32:30,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My first instinct was to avoid him.</font>

2510
01:32:36,880 --> 01:32:42,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Alone after calling off the date]</font>

2511
01:32:54,240 --> 01:32:55,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Eyes turning red]</font>

2512
01:32:55,680 --> 01:32:56,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How high is it?</font>

2513
01:32:56,680 --> 01:32:57,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">39°C.</font>

2514
01:32:57,240 --> 01:32:58,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">39°C? Okay.</font>

2515
01:32:58,200 --> 01:32:59,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then of course the date's off.</font>

2516
01:32:59,760 --> 01:33:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't disturb her now.</font>

2517
01:33:01,080 --> 01:33:01,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When she wakes up,</font>

2518
01:33:01,880 --> 01:33:03,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could you let me know?</font>

2519
01:33:03,000 --> 01:33:03,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll let you know.</font>

2520
01:33:03,680 --> 01:33:03,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, come get me.</font>

2521
01:33:03,960 --> 01:33:05,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go check on her.</font>

2522
01:33:22,640 --> 01:33:27,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Overwhelmed]</font>

2523
01:33:54,680 --> 01:33:55,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was pretty upset.</font>

2524
01:33:55,640 --> 01:33:57,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I felt like</font>

2525
01:33:57,680 --> 01:34:00,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my date had held her up.</font>

2526
01:34:00,400 --> 01:34:02,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her fever was 39°C,</font>

2527
01:34:02,200 --> 01:34:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and she might've needed an IV or something.</font>

2528
01:34:04,000 --> 01:34:05,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really blamed myself.</font>

2529
01:34:05,080 --> 01:34:06,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I sat in my room feeling awful about it.</font>

2530
01:34:06,680 --> 01:34:08,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Guilt over Liu Yuning's fever]
There was nothing I could do.</font>

2531
01:34:08,280 --> 01:34:10,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And that made me pretty upset.</font>

2532
01:34:17,440 --> 01:34:18,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What I just asked was,</font>

2533
01:34:18,720 --> 01:34:22,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could I spend the survival points I won today...</font>

2534
01:34:22,160 --> 01:34:24,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's already asleep, right?</font>

2535
01:34:24,480 --> 01:34:26,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd give up all my survival points.</font>

2536
01:34:26,320 --> 01:34:27,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd just like her to...</font>

2537
01:34:27,800 --> 01:34:28,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If she wakes up later</font>

2538
01:34:28,880 --> 01:34:30,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and she's still feeling that bad,</font>

2539
01:34:30,080 --> 01:34:32,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[All his points for Liu Yuning]
could she see a doctor off the island,</font>

2540
01:34:32,600 --> 01:34:33,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or something like that?</font>

2541
01:34:33,200 --> 01:34:33,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that okay?</font>

2542
01:34:36,680 --> 01:34:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Liu Yuning's awake.</font>

2543
01:34:38,240 --> 01:34:39,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, I'll go see her.</font>

2544
01:34:41,880 --> 01:34:45,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Rushes to see Liu Yuning]</font>

2545
01:34:54,640 --> 01:34:56,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can I come in?</font>

2546
01:34:56,360 --> 01:34:57,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't come in.</font>

2547
01:34:57,480 --> 01:34:57,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

2548
01:34:57,960 --> 01:34:58,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who is it?</font>

2549
01:34:58,760 --> 01:34:59,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can come in.</font>

2550
01:35:14,520 --> 01:35:15,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come in.</font>

2551
01:35:15,200 --> 01:35:16,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dong.</font>

2552
01:35:22,560 --> 01:35:23,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you okay?</font>

2553
01:35:23,240 --> 01:35:24,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fine.</font>

2554
01:35:24,080 --> 01:35:24,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

2555
01:35:24,600 --> 01:35:27,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't feel like I have a fever.</font>

2556
01:35:28,200 --> 01:35:29,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Stunned]</font>

2557
01:35:29,160 --> 01:35:30,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay. Get some rest.</font>

2558
01:35:32,600 --> 01:35:34,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you take him with you too?</font>

2559
01:35:38,120 --> 01:35:39,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

2560
01:35:39,200 --> 01:35:40,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel like my fever's about to go down,</font>

2561
01:35:40,800 --> 01:35:41,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and he'll make it go right back up.</font>

2562
01:35:41,840 --> 01:35:42,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right, let's go.</font>

2563
01:35:43,880 --> 01:35:44,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Helping get Huang Siyang out]</font>

2564
01:35:44,880 --> 01:35:45,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

2565
01:35:45,760 --> 01:35:46,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My man.</font>

2566
01:35:46,520 --> 01:35:48,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing, bro?</font>

2567
01:35:49,360 --> 01:35:50,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right, we're going.</font>

2568
01:35:50,560 --> 01:35:50,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye.</font>

2569
01:35:50,920 --> 01:35:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get some rest.</font>

2570
01:35:51,800 --> 01:35:52,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

2571
01:36:12,120 --> 01:36:13,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think Yang was in there too.</font>

2572
01:36:13,840 --> 01:36:14,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

2573
01:36:17,400 --> 01:36:19,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I went in really worried about her,</font>

2574
01:36:19,640 --> 01:36:23,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but she seemed fine.</font>

2575
01:36:23,680 --> 01:36:25,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She was sitting up in bed, chatting.</font>

2576
01:36:25,120 --> 01:36:25,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

2577
01:36:27,320 --> 01:36:28,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Caught off guard]
I wasn't expecting that.</font>

2578
01:36:31,920 --> 01:36:33,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean? Are you done?</font>

2579
01:36:35,240 --> 01:36:36,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you pick someone?</font>

2580
01:36:36,720 --> 01:36:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't.</font>

2581
01:37:08,760 --> 01:37:10,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[In tears]
What's wrong? Have you been crying?</font>

2582
01:37:12,120 --> 01:37:13,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her fever was 39°C.</font>

2583
01:37:15,000 --> 01:37:16,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And?</font>

2584
01:37:16,320 --> 01:37:18,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just got really upset.</font>

2585
01:37:18,120 --> 01:37:18,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought</font>

2586
01:37:18,720 --> 01:37:20,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if I hadn't picked her for a date,</font>

2587
01:37:20,800 --> 01:37:21,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">maybe she could've</font>

2588
01:37:21,680 --> 01:37:23,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">gone straight off the island to see a doctor.</font>

2589
01:37:24,400 --> 01:37:27,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">39°C is pretty high.</font>

2590
01:37:27,120 --> 01:37:27,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

2591
01:37:29,200 --> 01:37:31,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I just went in</font>

2592
01:37:31,280 --> 01:37:33,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and she seemed okay.</font>

2593
01:37:33,640 --> 01:37:35,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She told me she was fine.</font>

2594
01:37:35,080 --> 01:37:36,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She even got up.</font>

2595
01:37:36,960 --> 01:37:37,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, she didn't stand up.</font>

2596
01:37:37,680 --> 01:37:39,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She sat up and was talking</font>

2597
01:37:39,960 --> 01:37:41,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with Yang and the others.</font>

2598
01:37:41,960 --> 01:37:43,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She didn't look that sick.</font>

2599
01:37:54,720 --> 01:37:56,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hang on. I'll get you a tissue.</font>

2600
01:37:56,320 --> 01:37:57,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need.</font>

2601
01:37:57,000 --> 01:37:57,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm good.</font>

2602
01:37:59,720 --> 01:38:00,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

2603
01:38:00,400 --> 01:38:02,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you go out like that, people will see.</font>

2604
01:38:03,520 --> 01:38:04,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I'm really fine.</font>

2605
01:38:04,240 --> 01:38:05,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at me.</font>

2606
01:38:07,200 --> 01:38:08,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See? I'm fine.</font>

2607
01:38:09,800 --> 01:38:10,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, let's go.</font>

2608
01:38:21,040 --> 01:38:23,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It really felt like the whole world went gray.</font>

2609
01:38:23,040 --> 01:38:24,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was starting to feel</font>

2610
01:38:24,400 --> 01:38:25,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">like my mind was spinning out of control.</font>

2611
01:38:27,800 --> 01:38:29,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, dinner for two?</font>

2612
01:38:29,080 --> 01:38:30,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dinner for two?</font>

2613
01:38:30,720 --> 01:38:31,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you say?</font>

2614
01:38:31,600 --> 01:38:33,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine. No big deal. Let's go.</font>

2615
01:38:33,400 --> 01:38:35,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just dinner. Come on.</font>

2616
01:38:35,880 --> 01:38:37,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A date's just dinner anyway.</font>

2617
01:38:46,840 --> 01:38:48,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, take a seat.</font>

2618
01:38:48,800 --> 01:38:49,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're really...</font>

2619
01:38:49,560 --> 01:38:50,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're really on a date?</font>

2620
01:38:50,560 --> 01:38:51,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, a real date.</font>

2621
01:38:51,640 --> 01:38:52,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

2622
01:38:52,600 --> 01:38:53,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is actually really good.</font>

2623
01:38:55,200 --> 01:38:57,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Better than the food on any of my other dates.</font>

2624
01:38:57,040 --> 01:38:57,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

2625
01:38:57,880 --> 01:38:58,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's perfect for us.</font>

2626
01:39:02,840 --> 01:39:06,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This really hits the spot right now.</font>

2627
01:39:06,040 --> 01:39:06,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm just...</font>

2628
01:39:18,920 --> 01:39:21,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But honestly,</font>

2629
01:39:21,240 --> 01:39:23,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">after I saw you leave,</font>

2630
01:39:23,040 --> 01:39:24,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the medics went in a few times.</font>

2631
01:39:26,640 --> 01:39:28,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They really did. In and out.</font>

2632
01:39:28,120 --> 01:39:30,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something was up.</font>

2633
01:39:30,560 --> 01:39:31,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It looked pretty serious to me.</font>

2634
01:39:31,920 --> 01:39:33,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I asked who was sick.</font>

2635
01:39:33,040 --> 01:39:35,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I actually went out of my way to ask.</font>

2636
01:39:35,040 --> 01:39:37,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I usually stay out of that stuff.</font>

2637
01:39:42,160 --> 01:39:44,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I do think</font>

2638
01:39:44,040 --> 01:39:45,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it might've been serious.</font>

2639
01:39:50,720 --> 01:39:52,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's only so much you can tell by looking.</font>

2640
01:39:52,720 --> 01:39:53,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

2641
01:39:53,320 --> 01:39:53,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know what I mean?</font>

2642
01:39:53,680 --> 01:39:57,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Looks can be deceiving]</font>

2643
01:39:57,800 --> 01:40:00,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've already talked to them.</font>

2644
01:40:00,600 --> 01:40:02,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told them I'd use my survival points</font>

2645
01:40:02,720 --> 01:40:03,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to pay for whatever she needed.</font>

2646
01:40:04,880 --> 01:40:06,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd give up all my survival points</font>

2647
01:40:06,720 --> 01:40:09,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so she could leave the island to see a doctor</font>

2648
01:40:09,920 --> 01:40:10,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or just rest for the night.</font>

2649
01:40:12,200 --> 01:40:12,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told them all that.</font>

2650
01:40:25,360 --> 01:40:28,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Boiling water]</font>

2651
01:40:33,240 --> 01:40:35,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Checking the water temperature]</font>

2652
01:40:37,200 --> 01:40:39,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Rinsing the cup again]</font>

2653
01:40:44,960 --> 01:40:45,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm back.</font>

2654
01:40:48,440 --> 01:40:49,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

2655
01:40:50,640 --> 01:40:52,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course I brought some.</font>

2656
01:40:52,000 --> 01:40:53,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It really is hot water.</font>

2657
01:40:58,800 --> 01:41:01,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Calls the medics over]
Could you check her thermometer?</font>

2658
01:41:03,680 --> 01:41:03,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right.</font>

2659
01:41:07,760 --> 01:41:11,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Liu Yuning's temperature: 35.8°C]
35.8.</font>

2660
01:41:11,800 --> 01:41:13,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Staff]
Did you take medicine?</font>

2661
01:41:13,440 --> 01:41:16,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did. Was it some kind of miracle drug?</font>

2662
01:41:16,240 --> 01:41:17,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just took something for the fever, right?</font>

2663
01:41:17,320 --> 01:41:18,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

2664
01:41:18,480 --> 01:41:19,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That worked way too fast.</font>

2665
01:41:21,120 --> 01:41:23,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is the thermometer broken?</font>

2666
01:41:23,520 --> 01:41:25,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Staff]
Could you have misread it earlier?</font>

2667
01:41:25,920 --> 01:41:29,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I even asked him to double-check.</font>

2668
01:41:29,080 --> 01:41:30,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I checked it myself.</font>

2669
01:41:30,200 --> 01:41:31,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We both saw it.</font>

2670
01:41:31,720 --> 01:41:33,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you two nearsighted?</font>

2671
01:41:35,080 --> 01:41:36,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I seriously think you need glasses.</font>

2672
01:41:36,640 --> 01:41:37,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, my fever has to go down.</font>

2673
01:41:37,560 --> 01:41:39,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've got a date to get to.</font>

2674
01:41:39,920 --> 01:41:40,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're not going.</font>

2675
01:41:41,880 --> 01:41:43,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Watch it read 40°C next.</font>

2676
01:41:43,120 --> 01:41:44,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then you're coming with me to see a doctor.</font>

2677
01:41:47,160 --> 01:41:48,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No sunshine today.</font>

2678
01:41:48,160 --> 01:41:49,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Looks a little cloudy.</font>

2679
01:41:51,240 --> 01:41:52,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cloudy skies for Tianqing.</font>

2680
01:41:53,840 --> 01:41:54,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Sunny name, cloudy mood]
Bro.</font>

2681
01:42:00,480 --> 01:42:01,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know</font>

2682
01:42:01,480 --> 01:42:02,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who Xixi picked for her date?</font>

2683
01:42:03,880 --> 01:42:04,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She went on a date with Gao.</font>

2684
01:42:04,680 --> 01:42:05,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

2685
01:42:05,480 --> 01:42:05,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

2686
01:42:05,680 --> 01:42:06,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She went with Gao.</font>

2687
01:42:08,160 --> 01:42:09,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Honestly,</font>

2688
01:42:09,320 --> 01:42:10,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's pretty normal, right?</font>

2689
01:42:10,920 --> 01:42:13,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not like we've made any promises.</font>

2690
01:42:14,400 --> 01:42:16,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can just talk it through.</font>

2691
01:42:16,360 --> 01:42:17,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe she just wanted</font>

2692
01:42:17,320 --> 01:42:19,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to chat with him or something.</font>

2693
01:42:19,720 --> 01:42:20,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Totally normal.</font>

2694
01:42:21,280 --> 01:42:22,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Mood running low]
But honestly, I feel lousy too.</font>

2695
01:42:24,360 --> 01:42:24,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The brokenhearted club]
I get it.</font>

2696
01:42:26,440 --> 01:42:28,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's done nothing wrong, right?</font>

2697
01:42:28,440 --> 01:42:29,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Put yourself in her shoes.</font>

2698
01:42:29,880 --> 01:42:30,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really, put yourself in her shoes.</font>

2699
01:42:30,920 --> 01:42:31,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's what I'm doing.</font>

2700
01:42:31,880 --> 01:42:32,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's how I know it's okay.</font>

2701
01:42:32,920 --> 01:42:34,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think I'm still</font>

2702
01:42:34,240 --> 01:42:35,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">pretty lucky.</font>

2703
01:42:41,760 --> 01:42:44,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For one thing, I'm bad at reading signals.</font>

2704
01:42:44,840 --> 01:42:46,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And for another,</font>

2705
01:42:46,280 --> 01:42:48,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's a saying I really believe.</font>

2706
01:42:48,400 --> 01:42:49,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guys tend to</font>

2707
01:42:49,320 --> 01:42:51,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">get the wrong idea</font>

2708
01:42:51,240 --> 01:42:52,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and assume a girl is into them.</font>

2709
01:42:52,560 --> 01:42:53,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I always think</font>

2710
01:42:55,280 --> 01:42:57,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's too soon to assume anything.</font>

2711
01:42:57,640 --> 01:42:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, that's what I think too.</font>

2712
01:43:03,440 --> 01:43:04,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How come I didn't hear</font>

2713
01:43:04,600 --> 01:43:06,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that Wang Tianqing invited Wang Sheng?</font>

2714
01:43:06,320 --> 01:43:07,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you guys hear it?</font>

2715
01:43:07,080 --> 01:43:08,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you know Tianqing</font>

2716
01:43:08,080 --> 01:43:08,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is out with Wang Sheng?</font>

2717
01:43:08,520 --> 01:43:09,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you hear anything?</font>

2718
01:43:11,560 --> 01:43:12,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you hear an announcement</font>

2719
01:43:12,520 --> 01:43:14,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that Wang Tianqing invited Wang Sheng?</font>

2720
01:43:14,400 --> 01:43:15,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did I miss it?</font>

2721
01:43:15,560 --> 01:43:16,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Tianqing asked Wang Sheng?</font>

2722
01:43:16,560 --> 01:43:16,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

2723
01:43:16,840 --> 01:43:17,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look.</font>

2724
01:43:18,360 --> 01:43:19,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Seeing is believing]</font>

2725
01:43:19,680 --> 01:43:20,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why I asked.</font>

2726
01:43:20,280 --> 01:43:21,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was like, how come I didn't hear it?</font>

2727
01:43:23,400 --> 01:43:25,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't talk about it in the dorm.</font>

2728
01:43:25,760 --> 01:43:26,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not in the dorm.</font>

2729
01:43:26,480 --> 01:43:27,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seriously?</font>

2730
01:43:29,480 --> 01:43:31,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[A little awkward]</font>

2731
01:43:31,000 --> 01:43:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh no, they've all seen us.</font>

2732
01:43:32,320 --> 01:43:33,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look. This is so awkward.</font>

2733
01:43:33,160 --> 01:43:33,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, a little awkward.</font>

2734
01:43:37,200 --> 01:43:38,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seeing Tianqing</font>

2735
01:43:38,280 --> 01:43:39,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and Koala</font>

2736
01:43:39,280 --> 01:43:41,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">over there having a dinner</font>

2737
01:43:41,200 --> 01:43:41,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was pretty funny.</font>

2738
01:43:41,880 --> 01:43:42,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just thought...</font>

2739
01:43:42,240 --> 01:43:43,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wait, is this allowed?]</font>

2740
01:43:43,040 --> 01:43:44,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that allowed?</font>

2741
01:43:45,640 --> 01:43:46,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Curious onlookers]</font>

2742
01:43:46,920 --> 01:43:47,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How come I didn't hear</font>

2743
01:43:47,960 --> 01:43:49,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you invited Wang Sheng?</font>

2744
01:43:49,920 --> 01:43:50,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I asked him privately.</font>

2745
01:43:50,720 --> 01:43:52,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They don't announce dates between guys.</font>

2746
01:43:53,800 --> 01:43:54,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it.</font>

2747
01:43:55,680 --> 01:43:56,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So Shihan</font>

2748
01:43:56,080 --> 01:43:58,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">really hasn't picked anyone, right?</font>

2749
01:43:58,360 --> 01:43:59,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They went to the dining room together.</font>

2750
01:43:59,240 --> 01:43:59,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

2751
01:44:00,760 --> 01:44:02,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can't a guy help his buddy</font>

2752
01:44:02,520 --> 01:44:03,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">talk things through?</font>

2753
01:44:03,120 --> 01:44:03,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I mean...</font>

2754
01:44:03,600 --> 01:44:05,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right? They're just comparing notes.</font>

2755
01:44:05,680 --> 01:44:07,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's a loyal friend.</font>

2756
01:44:07,280 --> 01:44:08,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Why isn't Qian Shihan on her date?]
Why is she here? Isn't she on a date?</font>

2757
01:44:08,960 --> 01:44:10,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, why aren't you on your date?</font>

2758
01:44:10,560 --> 01:44:11,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it over already?</font>

2759
01:44:11,360 --> 01:44:13,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I haven't had it yet.</font>

2760
01:44:13,200 --> 01:44:13,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't gone.</font>

2761
01:44:13,960 --> 01:44:15,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where did Gao Yuheng go, then?</font>

2762
01:44:15,360 --> 01:44:15,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't know?</font>

2763
01:44:16,240 --> 01:44:17,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, you wouldn't know.</font>

2764
01:44:17,000 --> 01:44:17,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You weren't there.</font>

2765
01:44:19,400 --> 01:44:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xixi?</font>

2766
01:44:19,960 --> 01:44:21,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xixi picked Gao Yuheng.</font>

2767
01:44:21,920 --> 01:44:23,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Out of the loop]
You only just found out?</font>

2768
01:44:24,120 --> 01:44:25,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, right.</font>

2769
01:44:25,040 --> 01:44:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Neither of you knew, huh?</font>

2770
01:44:27,280 --> 01:44:33,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I keep reminding myself not to avoid things.</font>

2771
01:44:34,880 --> 01:44:35,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's a lot of fruit today.</font>

2772
01:44:37,640 --> 01:44:39,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Finally, we have fruit.</font>

2773
01:44:39,280 --> 01:44:40,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take some for Yuning.</font>

2774
01:44:40,200 --> 01:44:41,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Fruit for someone special]
She had a fever today.</font>

2775
01:44:42,960 --> 01:44:43,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's so you.</font>

2776
01:44:50,600 --> 01:44:51,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shall we go?</font>

2777
01:44:52,640 --> 01:44:53,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To the dining room?</font>

2778
01:44:54,800 --> 01:44:56,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go hang out with them.</font>

2779
01:44:56,400 --> 01:44:57,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This way.</font>

2780
01:45:03,720 --> 01:45:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Running into each other]</font>

2781
01:45:05,360 --> 01:45:06,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two?</font>

2782
01:45:06,040 --> 01:45:07,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two really went on a date?</font>

2783
01:45:07,640 --> 01:45:08,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

2784
01:45:08,320 --> 01:45:08,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just dinner.</font>

2785
01:45:08,840 --> 01:45:09,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you done eating?</font>

2786
01:45:09,520 --> 01:45:10,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We are.</font>

2787
01:45:10,000 --> 01:45:11,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're off to the next thing.</font>

2788
01:45:11,680 --> 01:45:12,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's fruit too.</font>

2789
01:45:12,280 --> 01:45:12,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nice.</font>

2790
01:45:13,200 --> 01:45:13,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

2791
01:45:25,160 --> 01:45:26,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm always in a good mood after a meal.</font>

2792
01:45:30,000 --> 01:45:31,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's sit in the dining room for a bit.</font>

2793
01:45:35,640 --> 01:45:36,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm feeling better.</font>

2794
01:45:36,880 --> 01:45:39,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come get some air with me.</font>

2795
01:45:39,760 --> 01:45:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Trying the fruit]
I'll try one.</font>

2796
01:45:40,840 --> 01:45:42,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you want?</font>

2797
01:45:42,240 --> 01:45:43,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is there?</font>

2798
01:45:43,400 --> 01:45:44,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I got you lots of fruit.</font>

2799
01:45:45,720 --> 01:45:47,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's the occasion?</font>

2800
01:45:47,720 --> 01:45:48,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[His puppy-dog moment]
Here, I'll feed you one.</font>

2801
01:45:48,800 --> 01:45:50,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which one do you want?</font>

2802
01:45:50,280 --> 01:45:51,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Close your eyes.</font>

2803
01:45:51,440 --> 01:45:53,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Close them. I'll give you a bite.</font>

2804
01:45:53,120 --> 01:45:54,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guess which one I'll pick.</font>

2805
01:45:59,760 --> 01:46:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it sweet?</font>

2806
01:46:02,360 --> 01:46:03,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Sweet melon]
It's melon.</font>

2807
01:46:06,320 --> 01:46:08,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Now try bitter melon]</font>

2808
01:46:09,640 --> 01:46:10,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How come you two came back from your date</font>

2809
01:46:10,920 --> 01:46:12,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">looking so glum?</font>

2810
01:46:12,160 --> 01:46:13,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The gloomy duo]
Are you upset?</font>

2811
01:46:13,200 --> 01:46:14,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

2812
01:46:14,200 --> 01:46:17,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're just in a food coma.</font>

2813
01:46:17,120 --> 01:46:18,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You really didn't have a date?</font>

2814
01:46:19,520 --> 01:46:20,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not yet.</font>

2815
01:46:20,480 --> 01:46:22,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came here to eat my fill first</font>

2816
01:46:22,000 --> 01:46:22,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and then go.</font>

2817
01:46:23,280 --> 01:46:23,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, I see.</font>

2818
01:46:23,880 --> 01:46:24,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you pick Gao?</font>

2819
01:46:24,960 --> 01:46:26,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So you have to wait a little longer,</font>

2820
01:46:26,040 --> 01:46:27,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">until he's done?</font>

2821
01:46:27,160 --> 01:46:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could be.</font>

2822
01:46:27,720 --> 01:46:29,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Joining the date]
Or I could just join them, you know?</font>

2823
01:46:29,840 --> 01:46:31,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, I get you. I get you.</font>

2824
01:46:31,040 --> 01:46:32,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know what to do this time.</font>

2825
01:46:32,160 --> 01:46:33,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Lesson learned]
I'll bring my own chair.</font>

2826
01:46:33,800 --> 01:46:34,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now that's smart.</font>

2827
01:46:34,600 --> 01:46:34,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yep.</font>

2828
01:46:36,400 --> 01:46:37,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Ren Chunxi and Gao Yuheng's date ends]</font>

2829
01:46:37,520 --> 01:46:38,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, are you done?</font>

2830
01:46:38,720 --> 01:46:39,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am.</font>

2831
01:46:39,280 --> 01:46:40,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

2832
01:46:40,480 --> 01:46:41,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's take a photo.</font>

2833
01:46:41,240 --> 01:46:42,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's so pretty here.</font>

2834
01:46:43,080 --> 01:46:43,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Gao.</font>

2835
01:46:48,040 --> 01:46:49,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, perfect.</font>

2836
01:46:51,840 --> 01:46:53,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Looking good.</font>

2837
01:46:54,040 --> 01:46:55,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you need to go back first</font>

2838
01:46:55,120 --> 01:46:57,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">before your next date?</font>

2839
01:46:57,280 --> 01:46:58,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know. Maybe.</font>

2840
01:47:00,920 --> 01:47:01,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

2841
01:47:01,680 --> 01:47:03,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take a breather.</font>

2842
01:47:03,520 --> 01:47:04,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How'd it go?</font>

2843
01:47:04,520 --> 01:47:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was Xixi.</font>

2844
01:47:05,560 --> 01:47:06,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know.</font>

2845
01:47:06,320 --> 01:47:07,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why'd she pick you?</font>

2846
01:47:07,400 --> 01:47:08,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She wants Wang Sheng to make a move.</font>

2847
01:47:08,240 --> 01:47:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right. She didn't want to...</font>

2848
01:47:09,000 --> 01:47:09,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She didn't want to date any guys today.</font>

2849
01:47:10,840 --> 01:47:12,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So she picked me.</font>

2850
01:47:12,520 --> 01:47:13,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm one of the girls, right?</font>

2851
01:47:15,320 --> 01:47:16,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today, for Yuning,</font>

2852
01:47:17,560 --> 01:47:18,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I boiled a kettle of water.</font>

2853
01:47:18,800 --> 01:47:19,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A whole kettle.</font>

2854
01:47:19,600 --> 01:47:20,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I brought her some fruit too.</font>

2855
01:47:21,200 --> 01:47:21,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nicely done, bro.</font>

2856
01:47:24,160 --> 01:47:24,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So sweet.</font>

2857
01:47:24,880 --> 01:47:25,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sweet.</font>

2858
01:47:25,920 --> 01:47:26,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really sweet.</font>

2859
01:47:26,600 --> 01:47:27,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, let's take a picture.</font>

2860
01:47:28,520 --> 01:47:29,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want something steady.</font>

2861
01:47:29,760 --> 01:47:31,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you've got another date in a bit.</font>

2862
01:47:31,000 --> 01:47:31,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I do.</font>

2863
01:47:36,320 --> 01:47:40,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qian Shihan, please head to the date zone.</font>

2864
01:47:40,000 --> 01:47:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Off on her date.</font>

2865
01:47:41,920 --> 01:47:42,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone's happy.</font>

2866
01:47:42,440 --> 01:47:43,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Happy again, girl.</font>

2867
01:47:44,720 --> 01:47:46,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can I bring a plate? Is that okay?</font>

2868
01:47:46,560 --> 01:47:47,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

2869
01:47:47,120 --> 01:47:48,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Bringing fruit]
I'll just take a little.</font>

2870
01:47:49,960 --> 01:47:52,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I bet they didn't get much to eat.</font>

2871
01:47:52,120 --> 01:47:53,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So someone asked you out?</font>

2872
01:47:53,920 --> 01:47:55,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's the one doing the asking.</font>

2873
01:47:55,640 --> 01:47:56,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I asked him.</font>

2874
01:47:57,560 --> 01:47:59,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Why not call the guy's name?]
Then why didn't they call his name?</font>

2875
01:47:59,960 --> 01:48:01,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Two dates for Gao Yuheng.</font>

2876
01:48:01,520 --> 01:48:02,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gao's having the time of his life again.</font>

2877
01:48:02,400 --> 01:48:04,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My voice was already hoarse yesterday.</font>

2878
01:48:04,120 --> 01:48:04,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And today...</font>

2879
01:48:05,800 --> 01:48:07,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Baojuan, my voice.]
Tomorrow I'll have no voice at all.</font>

2880
01:48:08,520 --> 01:48:11,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just want something steady and happy.</font>

2881
01:48:11,400 --> 01:48:12,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm off.</font>

2882
01:48:12,000 --> 01:48:13,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye.</font>

2883
01:48:15,400 --> 01:48:16,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on. Round 2.</font>

2884
01:48:18,080 --> 01:48:18,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My turn.</font>

2885
01:48:18,680 --> 01:48:19,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qian Shihan should go first.</font>

2886
01:48:26,040 --> 01:48:27,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's Annie's type?</font>

2887
01:48:28,560 --> 01:48:31,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She likes guys who put on a show.</font>

2888
01:48:37,600 --> 01:48:39,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did I tell you my ranking yesterday?</font>

2889
01:48:46,160 --> 01:48:46,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is...</font>

2890
01:48:54,080 --> 01:48:54,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's up?</font>

2891
01:48:56,680 --> 01:48:57,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She picked you.</font>

2892
01:49:11,000 --> 01:49:11,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can I join?</font>

2893
01:49:15,600 --> 01:49:16,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Next episode]
I think</font>

2894
01:49:16,840 --> 01:49:17,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm going to leave.</font>

2895
01:49:17,800 --> 01:49:18,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me explain.</font>

2896
01:49:18,640 --> 01:49:20,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My mind just went blank.</font>

2897
01:49:20,040 --> 01:49:21,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel pretty bad for her.</font>

2898
01:49:21,360 --> 01:49:22,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go find Annie.</font>

2899
01:49:22,120 --> 01:49:23,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Annie's on a date.</font>

2900
01:49:23,040 --> 01:49:23,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you going to see her for?</font>

2901
01:49:23,800 --> 01:49:25,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course I'm voting for you, you know?</font>

2902
01:49:25,160 --> 01:49:26,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

2903
01:49:26,080 --> 01:49:27,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't really think about how he'd feel.</font>

2904
01:49:27,560 --> 01:49:28,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just didn't ask him out.</font>

2905
01:49:28,680 --> 01:49:30,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's the first spark I've felt on the island.</font>

2906
01:49:30,800 --> 01:49:32,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was when we made pasta together.</font>

2907
01:49:32,440 --> 01:49:33,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is wild, bro. Absolutely wild.</font>

2908
01:49:33,840 --> 01:49:35,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think I'll give him</font>

2909
01:49:35,360 --> 01:49:36,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a bit more of my affection.</font>

2910
01:49:36,560 --> 01:49:37,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really winged it with my Moonstones that night.</font>

2911
01:49:37,920 --> 01:49:40,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I planned to wing it.</font>
